<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Biblica® Open Akuapem Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samuel Nhoma A Ɛto So Abien</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nhoma A Ɛto So Abien</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Te Saulo Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1"/>Saulo wu akyi no, Dawid san fii nkonim a odii Amalekfo so no mu bɛtenaa Siklag nnaanu. <verse eid="2SA 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2"/>Ne nnansa so no, ɔbarima bi fi Saulo nsraban mu a watetew ne ntade mu, atu mfutuma agu ne ti mu, de rekyerɛ sɛ ɔretwa adwo bae. Oduu Dawid nkyɛn no, ɔdan ne ho hwee fam nidi mu.<verse eid="2SA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3"/>Dawid bisaa no se, “Ɛhe na wufi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Obuae se, “Maguan afi Israel nsraban mu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4"/>Dawid bisaa no se, “Na ɛyɛɛ dɛn? Ɔko no kosii dɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Ɔkae se, “Mmarima no guan fii akono. Bebree totɔe. Na Saulo ne ne babarima Yonatan nso atotɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5"/>Enti Dawid bisaa aberante a ɔbɛbɔɔ no saa amanneɛ no se, “Ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wuhuu sɛ Saulo ne ne babarima Yonatan awuwu?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6"/>Aberante no buae se, “Mikofii Gilboa bepɔw so, na mekɔtoo sɛ Saulo sɛn ne peaw so a atamfo no nteaseɛnam ne nʼapɔnkɔsotefo mmɛn no ara. <verse eid="2SA 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7"/>Ɔdan ne ho a ohuu me no, ɔteɛɛ mu frɛɛ me se memmra. Mibisaa no se, ‘Menyɛ dɛn?’<verse eid="2SA 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8"/>“Obisaa me se, ‘Wo ne hena?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:8">“Mibuaa no se, ‘Meyɛ Amalekni.’<verse eid="2SA 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9"/>“Na ɔsrɛɛ me se, ‘Begyina me so na kum me, na me ho yeraw me yiye, na mepɛ sɛ me wu.’<verse eid="2SA 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10"/>“Enti migyinaa ne so kum no, efisɛ na minim sɛ tebea a ɔwɔ mu no, ɔrennya nkwa. Na mituu nʼahenkyɛw a ɛhyɛ no no ne nʼabasa so atweaban no sɛ mede rebrɛ wo, me wura.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11"/>Dawid ne ne mmarima no tee asɛm no, wɔde awerɛhow sunsuan wɔn ntade mu. <verse eid="2SA 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12"/>Wotwaa ho agyaadwo, sui, bua daa da mu no nyinaa wɔ Saulo ne ne babarima Yonatan wu ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asraafo ne Israelman sɛ wɔn mu pii wuwuu saa da no.<verse eid="2SA 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13"/>Na Dawid bisaa aberante a ɔbɛbɔɔ wɔn saa amanneɛ no se, “Wufi he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Na obuae se, “Meyɛ ɔhɔho Amalekni a mete mo asase so.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14"/>Dawid bisaa no se, “Na wunsuro sɛ wukum obi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asra no no?”<verse eid="2SA 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15"/>Dawid ka kyerɛɛ ne mmarima no mu baako se, “Kum no!” Enti ɔbarima no twee nʼafoa de wɔɔ Amalekni no, kum no. <verse eid="2SA 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16"/>Na Dawid kae se, “Wʼano ayi mmusu ama wo ama woawu, efisɛ wo ara na wokae se woakum obi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asra no no.”<verse eid="2SA 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Dwom A Ɔhyehyɛ Maa Saulo Ne Yonatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17"/>Na Dawid too kwadwom maa Saulo ne Yonatan. <verse eid="2SA 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18"/>Na ɔhyɛɛ sɛ wɔnkyerɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ Yuda nyinaa to. Wɔtoo no din sɛ agyan dwom a wɔakyerɛw wɔ Yasar Nhoma mu.<verse eid="2SA 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19"/>“Wʼanuonyam ne wʼahosɛpɛw, Israel, awu da mmepɔw so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">Akofo akɛse atotɔ!<verse eid="2SA 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20"/>“Monnka asɛm yi wɔ Gat,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gat ne Askelon yɛ Filisti nkurow.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">na Filistifo abɔ ose!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">Monnka wɔ Askelon mmɔnten so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">na abosonsomfo anserew ahosɛpɛw mu.<verse eid="2SA 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21"/>“Gilboa mmepɔw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">mma obosu anaa osu ntɔ ngu wo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">anaa wo nsian so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Efisɛ ɛhɔ na woguu ɔkofo kɛse no akokyɛm ho fi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">wɔremfa ngo nsra Saulo nkatabo ho bio.<verse eid="2SA 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22"/>“Saulo ne Yonatan kunkum wɔn atamfo ahoɔdenfo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">Wɔamfi akono amma no nsapan.<verse eid="2SA 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23"/>Ɔdɔ ne ahoɔfɛ bɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">na na Saulo ne Yonatan nni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">wɔn mu antetew da, nkwa ne owu mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Na wɔn ho yɛ hare kyɛn akɔre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">na wɔn ho yɛ den kyɛn gyata.<verse eid="2SA 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24"/>“Israel mmabea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">munsu Saulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">efisɛ ofuraa mo ntama pa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">hyehyɛɛ mo sikakɔkɔɔ agude.<verse eid="2SA 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25"/>“Akofo akɛse atotɔ akono.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonatan awu da mmepɔw no so.<verse eid="2SA 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26"/>Misu wo, me nua Yonatan!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">Na wosom me bo yiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Na wo dɔ a wowɔ ma me no yɛ nwonwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">emu dɔ sen ɔbea dɔ!<verse eid="2SA 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27"/>“Hwɛ sɛnea akofo akɛse atotɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">Ɔko mu akode ayerayera!”<verse eid="2SA 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Di Yuda So Hene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1"/>Mmere no ara mu, Dawid bisaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Mensan nkɔ Yuda ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa no se, “Kɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Dawid bisaa no se, “Kurow bɛn na menkɔ so?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa no se, “Hebron.”<verse eid="2SA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2"/>Na Dawid yerenom ne Ahinoam a ofi Yesreel ne Abigail a ofi Karmel a na ɔyɛ Nabal yere no. Enti Dawid ne ne yerenom, <verse eid="2SA 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3"/>ne ne mmarima ne wɔn fifo nyinaa tu kɔɔ Yuda, na wɔkɔtenaa Hebron ne ne nkurow so. <verse eid="2SA 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4"/>Afei, Yuda ntuanofo kɔɔ Hebron, kɔsraa Dawid ngo sii no hene wɔ Yuda abusuakuw so.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Na bere a Dawid tee sɛ Yabes Gilead mmarima asie Saulo no, <verse eid="2SA 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5"/>ɔsomaa abɔfo kosee wɔn se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira mo sɛ moayi nokware a ɛte saa adi, ama mo wura Saulo, na moasie no anuonyam so. <verse eid="2SA 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6"/>Na afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo nni no yiye na ontua mo dɔ sononko yi so ka. Na me nso metua mo nea a moayɛ yi so ka. <verse eid="2SA 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7"/>Afei a Saulo awu yi, mepɛ sɛ mobɛyɛ mʼasomfo nokwafo sɛ Yudafo a wɔasra me ngo sɛ minni wɔn so hene no.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Is-Boset Di Hene Wɔ Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8"/>Na Ner babarima Abner a na ɔyɛ Saulo safohene wɔ nʼakofo so ne Saulo babarima Is-Boset kɔɔ Mahanaim. <verse eid="2SA 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9"/>Ɛhɔ na osii Is-Boset hene wɔ Gilead, Yesreel, Efraim, Benyamin, Asurifo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asuri yɛ Aser abusuakuw mu nnipa.</char></note> asase ne Israel nyinaa so.<verse eid="2SA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10"/>Bere a Is-Boset dii ade no, na wadi mfirihyia aduanan, na odii ade fi Mahanaim mfe abien. Na Yuda abusuakuw no dii Dawid nokware. <verse eid="2SA 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11"/>Dawid yɛɛ Hebron ne kuropɔn. Na odii Yuda so hene mfirihyia ason ne fa.<verse eid="2SA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ne Yuda Di Ako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12"/>Da koro bi, Abner dii Is-Boset asraafo anim, fi Mahanaim kɔɔ Gibeon. <verse eid="2SA 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13"/>Saa bere koro no ara mu, Seruia babarima Yoab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoab te sɛ Abisai ne Asahel nyinaa na na wɔyɛ Dawid wɔfaasenom (nkyekyɛmu 8).</char></note> nso dii Dawid asraafo anim, fi Hebron na wohyiaa Abner wɔ Gibeon ɔtare ho. Akuw abien no tenatenaa ase a na wodi nhwɛanim. <verse eid="2SA 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14"/>Afei, Abner susuw ho kyerɛɛ Yoab se, “Ma yɛmfa yɛn akofo no mu kakra, na wɔmfa wɔn nsa nni ako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Yoab penee so kae se, “Wɔnsɔre nko ɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15"/>Enti woyii mmarima dumien fii kuw biara mu sɛ wonni wɔn ho ako. <verse eid="2SA 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16"/>Obiara soo ne tamfo tinwi mu, de nʼafoa wowɔɔ wɔn ho wɔn ho, maa wɔn nyinaa wuwui. Enti wɔfrɛ atɔe mu hɔ se Afoa Afuw de besi nnɛ.<verse eid="2SA 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17"/>Afei, nsraadɔm abien no de ɔko hyehyɛɛ so, na saa da no baa awiei no, na Dawid nsraadɔm no adi Abner ne Israel so nkonim.<verse eid="2SA 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asahel Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18"/>Na Yoab, Abisai ne Asahel a wɔyɛ Seruia mmabarima baasa no ka Dawid asraafo no ho saa da no. Na Asahel tu mmirika te sɛ ɔforote, <verse eid="2SA 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19"/>na ɔpam Abner ara sɛ ɔbɛkyere no. <verse eid="2SA 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20"/>Bere a Abner twaa nʼani huu sɛ odi nʼakyi no, ɔteɛɛ mu se, “Wo ni, Asahel!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Obuae se, “Yiw, ɛyɛ me!” <verse eid="2SA 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21"/>Na Abner ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Ɛno de, kɔhwehwɛ obi foforo, na wone no nko. Kɔ na kotintim mmerante no baako, na gye nʼakode a ɛwɔ ne ho nyinaa.” Nanso Asahel, kɔɔ so taa no.<verse eid="2SA 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22"/>Bio, Abner teɛɛ mu ka kyerɛɛ Asahel se, “Fi ha kɔ! Sɛ mikum wo a, merentumi nhwɛ wo nuabarima Yoab anim.”<verse eid="2SA 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23"/>Nanso Asahel antie ara, enti Abner de ne peaw no wɔɔ ne yafunu mu, maa peaw no pue fii nʼakyi. Obu hwee fam wuu wɔ hɔ. Na obiara a oduu atɔe mu hɔ no gyinaa dinn hwɛɛ Asahel sɛ ɔda hɔ.<verse eid="2SA 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24"/>Bere a Yoab ne Abisai tee asɛm a asi no, wɔkɔɔ sɛ wɔrekɔhwehwɛ Abner. Bere a woduu Amma bepɔw a ɛbɛn Gia a ɛwɔ ɔkwan a ɛda hɔ kɔ Gibeon sare so no, na onwini adwo. <verse eid="2SA 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25"/>Abner asraafo a wofi Benyamin abusuakuw mu no boaa wɔn ho ano wɔ bepɔw no so yɛɛ krado maa ɔko.<verse eid="2SA 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26"/>Ɛhɔ na Abner teɛɛ mu, ka kyerɛɛ Yoab se, “Enti, ɛsɛ sɛ daa yɛfa afoa so de ka yɛn ntam asɛm ana? Munnhu sɛ, saa ɔkwan no de nitan bɛto yɛn ntam ana? Da bɛn na wobɛfrɛ wo mmarima no aka akyerɛ wɔn se, wonnyae wɔn nuanom Israelfo akyidi?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27"/>Na Yoab kae se, “Sɛ woankasa a anka, Onyankopɔn nko ara na onim nea ɛbɛba; anka yɛbɛtaa wo anadwo mu no nyinaa.”<verse eid="2SA 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28"/>Enti Yoab hyɛn ne torobɛnto,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ wɔhyɛn torobɛnto a na ɛkyerɛ ɔko bi mfiase anaasɛ nʼawiei.</char></note> maa ne mmarima no gyaee Israel asraafo no taa.<verse eid="2SA 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29"/>Anadwo mu no nyinaa, Abner ne ne mmarima nantew kɔɔ Araba. Wotwaa Yordan bon, toaa so kɔɔ Bitron, beduu Mahanaim.<verse eid="2SA 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30"/>Na Yoab gyaee Abner akyidi, na ɔboaboaa ne mmarima ano. Asahel akyi no, wohuu sɛ Dawid mmarima no mu dunkron ayera. <verse eid="2SA 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31"/>Nanso na Dawid mmarima no akunkum Benyaminfo no mu nnipa ahansia ne aduosia a na wɔka Abner ho no. <verse eid="2SA 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32"/>Wɔfaa Asahel siee no wɔ nʼagya ɔboda mu wɔ Betlehem. Na Yoab ne ne mmarima nantew anadwo mu no nyinaa koduu Hebron adekyee.<verse eid="2SA 2:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1"/>Ɔko a ɛbɛtɔɔ wɔn a wɔwɔ Saulo afa ne wɔn a wɔwɔ Dawid afa no kyɛe yiye, na ne mfiase ni. Bere a Dawid adedi renya ahoɔden no na Saulo adedi no resɛe.<verse eid="2SA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2"/>Eyinom ne Dawid mmabarima a wɔwoo wɔn wɔ Hebron:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:2"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:2">Nʼabakan no din de Amnon a ɔyɛ Ahinoam a ofi Yesreel no babarima.<verse eid="2SA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3"/>Nea ɔto so abien no din de Kileab a ɔyɛ Abigail a na ɔyɛ Nabal a ofi Karmel no kunabea babarima;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:3">nea ɔto so abiɛsa no din de Absalom a ɔyɛ Gesurhene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gesur yɛ Siria ahemman ketewa bi a ɛhɔ na Absalom kɔpɛɛ guankɔbea (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 13:37-38">13.37-38</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 14:23">14.23</ref></char>).</char></note> Talmai babea Maaka babarima.<verse eid="2SA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4"/>Nea ɔto so anan no din de Adoniya a ɔyɛ Hagit babarima;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:4">nea ɔto so anum no din de Sefatia a ɔyɛ Abital babarima.<verse eid="2SA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5"/>Na nea ɔto so asia no din de Yitream a ɔyɛ Dawid yere Egla babarima.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:5"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="2SA 3:5">Wɔwoo saa mma yi maa Dawid wɔ Hebron.<verse eid="2SA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abner Kɔdɔm Dawid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6"/>Bere a na ɔko a ɛda Saulo fi ne Dawid fi no gu so no, na Abner agye din ama nʼankasa ne ho wɔ Saulo fi. <verse eid="2SA 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7"/>Na Saulo wɔ mpena bi a wɔfrɛ no Rispa, a ɔyɛ Aia babea. Na Is-Boset bisaa Abner se, “Adɛn nti na wo ne mʼagya mpena dae?”<verse eid="2SA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8"/>Abner bo fuw yiye kae se, “Meyɛ akraman sodifo wɔ Yuda na wɔadwoodwoo me saa? Nea mayɛ ama wo ne wʼagya, a manyi mo amma Dawid no, mʼayeyi ne sɛ, mode ɔbea yi ho asɛm rekyekyere me? <verse eid="2SA 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9"/>Sɛ mammoa Dawid amma ne nsa anka nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ ho bɔ no a, Onyankopɔn ne me nni no ɔnwene so. <verse eid="2SA 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10"/>Mede Saulo ahenni bɛkɔ akɔma Dawid na matim Dawid ahengua ase wɔ Israel ne Yuda so afi Dan akosi Beer-Seba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11"/>Esiane sɛ na Is-Boset suro Abner nti, wantumi ankasa bio.<verse eid="2SA 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12"/>Afei, Abner tuu abɔfo kɔɔ Dawid nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Ma yɛnyɛ nhyehyɛe na mɛboa ama yɛadan Israelman mu no nyinaa ama wo.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13"/>Dawid buae se, “Ɛyɛ asɛm papa, nanso me ne wo renyɛ saa nhyehyɛe no gye sɛ, sɛ woreba a, wode me yere Mikal a ɔyɛ Saulo babea no brɛ me.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14"/>Enti, Dawid soma ma wɔkɔbɔɔ Saulo babarima Is-Boset amanneɛ se, “Ma me nsa nka me yere Mikal, efisɛ mede Filistifo ɔha nkwa na ɛtɔɔ no.”<verse eid="2SA 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15"/>Enti Is-Boset gyee Mikal fii ne kunu Paltiel a ɔyɛ Lais babarima no nsam. <verse eid="2SA 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16"/>Na Paltiel de osu dii ɔbea no akyi koduu Bahurim. Na Abner ka kyerɛɛ no se, “San kɔ fie.” Na Paltiel san kɔɔ fie.<verse eid="2SA 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17"/>Na Abner ne Israel ntuanofo adidi nkɔmmɔ. Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Mmere kakra a atwam no, na mopɛ sɛ musi Dawid ɔhene. <verse eid="2SA 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18"/>Bere no ni. Efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka se, ‘Mayi Dawid sɛ onnye me nkurɔfo mfi Filistifo ne wɔn atamfo nyinaa nsam.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19"/>Abner san ne Benyamin abusua mu ntuanofo kasae. Afei, ɔkɔɔ Hebron kɔbɔɔ Dawid amanneɛ se, Israel nyinaa ne Benyamin taa wʼakyi. <verse eid="2SA 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20"/>Bere a Abner ne ne mmarima aduonu baa Hebron no, Dawid too wɔn pon kɛse. <verse eid="2SA 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21"/>Na Abner ka kyerɛɛ Dawid se, “Ma menkɔ na menkɔfrɛ Israel nnipa nyinaa na wɔmmra wʼafa. Wɔne wo bɛyɛ apam, na wɔasi wo hene. Na ɛbɛma woadi biribiara a wo koma pɛ so.” Enti Dawid maa Abner kɔɔ dwoodwoo.<verse eid="2SA 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoab Kum Abner</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22"/>Abner kɔe ara pɛ, Yoab ne Dawid asraafo no bi fi ɔsa mu bae a wokura asade bebree. <verse eid="2SA 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23"/>Bere a wɔka kyerɛɛ Yoab se Abner baa hɔ nkyɛe koraa, na ɔbɛsraa ɔhene, ama ɔhene ama no kɔ asomdwoe mu no, <verse eid="2SA 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24"/>Yoab yɛɛ ntɛm kohuu ɔhene bisaa no se, “Dɛn na woayɛ yi? Abner kɔ a womaa no kɔe yi, wokyerɛ dɛn? <verse eid="2SA 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25"/>Wunim pefee sɛ, ɔbaa wo so sɛ ɔkwansrafo, bɛhwehwɛɛ nea woreyɛ nyinaa mu ana?”<verse eid="2SA 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Yoab fi Dawid nkyɛn, na ɔsomaa abɔfo sɛ wontiw Abner. Wɔkɔtoo no Sira ɔtare ho, twee no de no bae. Nanso na Dawid nnim ho hwee. <verse eid="2SA 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27"/>Afei, Abner san kɔɔ Hebron no, Yoab frɛɛ no kɔɔ nkyɛn kosii ɔpon ano te sɛ nea ɔrekɔka kokoamsɛm akyerɛ no no. Na ɛhɔ no na esiane sɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔtɔ ne nuabarima Asahel so were no nti, Yoab wɔɔ Abner yafunu mu afoa ma owui.<verse eid="2SA 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28"/>Akyiri no a Dawid tee asɛm no, ɔkae se, “Me ne mʼaheman nnim saa asɛm a ɛfa Abner yi ho hwee wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. <verse eid="2SA 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29"/>Ne mogya ngu Yoab ne nʼagya fi so! Yoab fi de, awo ntoatoaso mu nyinaa, obi a watutu akuru anaa ɔyare kwata, nea ɔnam pema ho nantew anaa nea owu afoa ano ne nea ɔsrɛsrɛ aduan rempa hɔ da.”<verse eid="2SA 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30"/>Yoab ne ne nuabarima Abisai kum Abner, efisɛ Abner kum wɔn nuabarima Asahel wɔ akono wɔ Gibeon.<verse eid="2SA 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Su Abner</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31"/>Na Dawid ka kyerɛɛ Yoab ne nnipa a wɔka ne ho no nyinaa se, “Munsunsuan mo ntama mu, na mumfura atweaatam. Muntwa Abner ho agyaadwo.” Na ɔhene Dawid ankasa dii santen a wɔato no akyi, kɔɔ ɔda no so. <verse eid="2SA 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32"/>Wosiee Abner wɔ Hebron, na ɔhene Dawid ne nnipa no nyinaa suu wɔ ne da no ho.<verse eid="2SA 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33"/>Afei, ɔhene too saa kwadwom yi maa Abner:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Ɛsɛ sɛ Abner wu sɛnea nkwaseafo wu ana?<verse eid="2SA 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34"/>Wɔankyekyere wo nsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">wɔangu wo nan nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Dabi, wodii wo awu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">amumɔyɛfo atirimpɔw so ade.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Nnipa no nyinaa suu Abner bio. <verse eid="2SA 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35"/>Da a wɔreyɛ ayi no, Dawid annidi da mu no nyinaa, maa afei, obiara srɛɛ no se onnidi. Nanso na Dawid aka ntam se, “Sɛ mididi ansa na owia akɔtɔ a, Onyankopɔn nkum me.”<verse eid="2SA 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36"/>Eyi sɔɔ nnipa no ani yiye. Nokware, biribiara a ɔhene no yɛe no sɔɔ ɔmanfo no ani. <verse eid="2SA 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37"/>Eyi maa obiara a ɔte Yuda ne Israel no huu sɛ, ɛnyɛ ɔhene Dawid na okum Abner.<verse eid="2SA 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38"/>Na ɔhene Dawid bisaa ɔmanfo no se, “Munhu sɛ ɔkannifo kɛse ne onipa kɛse atɔ fam nnɛ wɔ Israel ana? <verse eid="2SA 3:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39"/>Na ɛwɔ mu sɛ me ne ɔhene a wɔasra no de, nanso Seruia mmabarima Yoab ne Abisai de, wɔyɛ den dodo ma me sɛ metumi aka wɔn ahyɛ. Ɛno nti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ntua saa mmarima amumɔyɛfo yi so ka wɔ wɔn amumɔyɛsɛm ho.”<verse eid="2SA 3:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Is-Boset Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1"/>Bere a Is-Boset tee sɛ Abner awu wɔ Hebron no, nʼaba mu bui, na saa ara nso na ne nkurɔfo no bɔɔ huboa. <verse eid="2SA 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2"/>Afei, na anuanom baanu a wɔn din de Baana ne Rekab na na wɔyɛ asafohene ma Is-Boset akofo no. Na wɔyɛ Rimon a ofi Benyamin fi wɔ Beerot kurow mu no mmabarima. Wɔfa no sɛ kurow Beerot ka Benyamin ho, <verse eid="2SA 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3"/>efisɛ wɔn a na wɔte Beerot mmere bi no guan kɔɔ Gitaim a wɔda so te hɔ sɛ ahɔho de besi nnɛ yi.<verse eid="2SA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4"/>Na Saulo babarima Yonatan wɔ ɔbabarima bi a ne din de Mefiboset a na ɔyɛ obubuafo fi ne mmofraase. Wokum Saulo ne Yonatan wɔ Yesreel akono no, na abofra no adi mfe anum. Bere a ɔko no ho asɛm duu kurow no mu no, obi a ɔhwɛ abofra no kyekyeree no de no guanee. Nanso bere a ɔreguan no, ɔhwee ase maa abofra no bɔɔ fam, ma ɔyɛɛ obubuafo.<verse eid="2SA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5"/>Da bi, Beerotni, Rimon mmabarima baanu a wɔn din de Rekab ne Baana kɔɔ Is-Boset fi awia bere mu a na ɔregye nʼahome. <verse eid="2SA 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6"/>Wowuraa mu kɔɔ ne pia mu te sɛnea wɔrekɔpɛ awi, kɔwɔɔ ne yafunu mu afoa. Afei Rekab ne Baana wiawiaa wɔn ho guanee.<verse eid="2SA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7"/>Ansa na wɔbɛkɔ no, wotwaa ne ti bere a ɔda ne mpa so. Wɔfaa ne ti no kotwaa Yordan bon no, nantew anadwo mu no nyinaa kɔe. <verse eid="2SA 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8"/>Wɔde Is-Boset ti no brɛɛ Dawid wɔ Hebron, na wɔka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no se, “Wo tamfo Saulo a anka ɔrehwehwɛ wo akum wo no babarima Is-Boset ti ni. Nnɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama me wo aweretɔ ho kwan atia Saulo ne nʼabusua.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9"/>Na Dawid buaa Beerotni Rimon mma Rekab ne ne nua Baana se, “Mmere dodow a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ogyee me fii ɔhaw ne abɛbrɛsɛ mu te ase yi, mɛka nokware akyerɛ mo. <verse eid="2SA 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10"/>Bere a onipa bi bɛka kyerɛɛ me se, ‘Saulo awu’ a na osusuw sɛ ɔreka asɛm pa akyerɛ me no, mekyeree no kum no wɔ Siklag. Nʼasɛm a ɔbɛka kyerɛɛ me no so akatua a mede maa no ne no. <verse eid="2SA 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11"/>Na akatua bɛn na memfa mma amumɔyɛfo a wɔakum obi a ne ho nni asɛm wɔ ne fi bere a ɔda ne mpa so? Ɛnsɛ sɛ mibisa ne mogya fi mo nsam ana?”<verse eid="2SA 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12"/>Enti Dawid hyɛɛ ne mmarima ma wokunkum wɔn. Wotwitwaa wɔn nsa ne wɔn anan, na wɔde asin no sensɛn Hebron ɔtare ho. Na wɔfaa Is-Boset ti no kosiee no wɔ Abner ɔboda mu wɔ Hebron.<verse eid="2SA 4:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Di Israel Nyinaa So Hene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1"/>Afei, Israel mmusuakuw no nyinaa kɔɔ Dawid nkyɛn wɔ Hebron kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Yɛn nyinaa yɛ wʼabusuafo. <verse eid="2SA 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2"/>Mmere bi a atwa mu no a mpo, na Saulo yɛ yɛn hene no, wo ara na wudii Israel anim. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ wo se, ‘Wobɛyɛ me manfo Israel so guanhwɛfo. Wobɛyɛ wɔn kannifo.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3"/>Enti Dawid ne Israel ntuanofo no yɛɛ apam wɔ Hebron <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. Na wɔsraa no ngo sii no Israelhene.<verse eid="2SA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4"/>Dawid dii ade no, na wanya mfirihyia aduasa. Na odii ade mfirihyia aduanan. <verse eid="2SA 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5"/>Ɔtenaa Hebron dii ade wɔ Yuda so mfirihyia ason ne asram asia. Na ɔtenaa Yerusalem no nso, odii Israel ne Yuda nyinaa so hene mfirihyia aduasa abiɛsa.<verse eid="2SA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Ko Fa Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6"/>Dawid dii nʼakofo anim kɔɔ Yerusalem kɔko tiaa Yebusifo. Yebusifo no dii wɔn ho fɛw se, “Morentumi mma ha. Na mpo, anifuraefo ne mmubuafo betu mo afi ha.” Efisɛ na Yebusifo no dwene sɛ wɔwɔ bammɔ. <verse eid="2SA 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7"/>Nanso Dawid ko faa Sion aban no a mprempren wɔfrɛ no Dawid Kuropɔn no.<verse eid="2SA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8"/>Bere a animka nkra fi bammɔfo a wɔwɔ kurow no mu duu Dawid asom no, ɔka kyerɛɛ ne dɔm no se, “Momfa nsudorobɛn no mu nkɔ kurow no mu, na monkɔsɛe Yebusifo mpakye ne anifuraefo no, efisɛ mikyi wɔn! Ɛno nti na wɔka se, ‘Anifuraefo ne mpakye’ renkɔ ahemfi” no.<verse eid="2SA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9"/>Enti Dawid yɛɛ nʼatenae wɔ abandennen na ɔfrɛɛ hɔ Dawid Kuropɔn no mu. Osisii bammɔ adan bebree twaa kurow no ho kaa ho. Wofii dwumadi no ase wɔ Milo de baa mu. <verse eid="2SA 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10"/>Na Dawid kɔɔ so yɛɛ kɛse adekyee biara, efisɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Nyankopɔn ka ne ho.<verse eid="2SA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11"/>Afei, Tirohene Huram somaa abɔfo kɔɔ Dawid nkyɛn a nnua dwumfo ne abo adansifo ka wɔn ho sɛ wonkosi ahemfi mma no. Huram de sida nnua bebree kɔɔ hɔ sɛ wɔmpae. <verse eid="2SA 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12"/>Na Dawid huu sɛ, ne nkurɔfo Israelfo nti, Awurade asi no hene, na wayɛ nʼaheman kɛse.<verse eid="2SA 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13"/>Dawid tu fi Hebron baa Yerusalem no, ɔwaree mmea bebree, faa mpenanom nso. Ɛno nti, ɔwoo mmabarima ne mmabea bebree. <verse eid="2SA 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14"/>Eyinom ne Dawid mmabarima a wɔwowoo wɔn wɔ Yerusalem no: Samua, Sobab, Natan, Salomo <verse eid="2SA 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15"/>Yibhar, Elisua, Nefeg, Yafia <verse eid="2SA 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16"/>Elisama, Eliada ne Elifelet.<verse eid="2SA 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Di Filistifo So Nkonim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17"/>Bere a Filistifo tee sɛ wɔasra Dawid, de no asi Israelhene no, wɔboaboaa wɔn asraafo ano, kɔhwehwɛɛ Dawid sɛ wobenya no akyere no. Na Dawid tee no, ɔno nso kɔɔ ne ban mu. <verse eid="2SA 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18"/>Afei, Filistifo no beduu Refaim bon mu, na wɔtrɛtrɛw wɔn ho mu wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="2SA 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19"/>Enti Dawid bisaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Menkɔtow nhyɛ Filistifo yi so ana? Wobɛdan wɔn ahyɛ me nsa ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa no se, “Yiw, kɔ na mɛdan Filistifo no ahyɛ wo nsa.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20"/>Enti Dawid kɔɔ Baal-Perasim, na ɛhɔ na odii Filistifo no so nkonim. Ɔkae se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ! Ɔbɔ wuraa mʼatamfo no mu sɛ nsuyiri a ɛworo so!” Enti Dawid too beae hɔ din se Baal-Perasim. <verse eid="2SA 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21"/>Filistifo no gyaw wɔn ahoni wɔ hɔ, maa Dawid ne ne mmarima no soaa ne nyinaa kɔe.<verse eid="2SA 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22"/>Filistifo no san baa bio bɛtrɛtrɛw wɔn ho mu wɔ Refaim bon ho, <verse eid="2SA 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23"/>enti Dawid bisaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nea ɔnyɛ. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buae se, “Nkɔ tee, mmom, twa fa wɔn ho wɔ wɔn akyi, na tow hyɛ wɔn so wɔ baka nnua no anim. <verse eid="2SA 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24"/>Na sɛ wote nnyigyei te sɛ nsrabɔ bi wɔ baka nnua no atifi a, bɔ toa wɔn! Ɛkyerɛ sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> atu di wʼanim rekokunkum Filistifo no.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25"/>Enti Dawid yɛɛ nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ no no, na ɔsɛee Filistifo no fi Geba de kosii Geser.<verse eid="2SA 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔde Apam Adaka No Kɔ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1"/>Na Dawid boaboaa Israel mmabun a wɔn ho mmu wɔn dwɛ mpem aduasa ano. <verse eid="2SA 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2"/>Odii wɔn anim fi Baala a ɛwɔ Yuda, sɛ wɔrekɔfa Onyankopɔn Adaka, a ekura <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Tumfo no a wɔde no asi kerubim ntam no din. <verse eid="2SA 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3"/>Wɔde Onyankopɔn Adaka no sii teaseɛnam foforo so, de fii Abinadab fi a na ɛwɔ bepɔw so no bae. Usa ne Ahio a na wɔyɛ Abinadab mmabarima no na na wɔkyerɛ teaseɛnam foforo no <verse eid="2SA 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4"/>a na Onyankopɔn Adaka no si mu no kwan. Na Ahio na odi anim. <verse eid="2SA 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5"/>Dawid ne Israel manfo gyee wɔn ani wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim wɔ ahoɔden so a wɔreto nnwom, na wɔde asanku, mmɛnta, akasae, mfirikyiwa ne kyɛnkyɛn nenam mu.<verse eid="2SA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6"/>Na woduu Nakon awiporowbea no, nantwi no nan totoe, maa Usa teɛɛ ne nsa soo Onyankopɔn Adaka no mu sɛ ɔreteɛ no. <verse eid="2SA 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuw Usa sɛ ɔyɛɛ saa, na Onyankopɔn bɔɔ no ma owu daa adaka no ho.<verse eid="2SA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8"/>Dawid nso bo fuw, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw atia Usa. Ɔtoo saa beae hɔ din Peres-Usa a ase ne abufuwhyew a etia Usa. Wɔfrɛ hɔ saa ara de besi nnɛ.<verse eid="2SA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9"/>Afei, na Dawid suro <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nti obisaa se, “Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adaka no bɛba me nkyɛn?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10"/>Na Dawid yɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ, ɔremma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Adaka no so nkɔ Dawid Kuropɔn no mu. Na mmom, ɔmaa so de kɔɔ Obed-Edom a ɔyɛ Gatni fi. <verse eid="2SA 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adaka no sii Gatni Obed-Edom fifo nkyɛn asram abiɛsa, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyiraa no ne ne fi mu nnipa nyinaa.<verse eid="2SA 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12"/>Afei, wɔka kyerɛɛ ɔhene Dawid se, “Esiane <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Adaka no nti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyira Obed-Edom fi ne biribiara a ɔwɔ so.” Enti Dawid kɔɔ hɔ kɔfaa Adaka no, de osebɔ kɛse baa Dawid Kuropɔn no mu. <verse eid="2SA 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13"/>Nnipa a na wɔso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Adaka no tuu anammɔn asia pɛ, wogyinaa hɔ twɛnee, sɛnea Dawid betumi de nantwi ne nantwi ba a wadɔ srade abɔ afɔre. <verse eid="2SA 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14"/>Na Dawid fii nʼahoɔden nyinaa mu saw wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim a na ɔhyɛ asɔfotade yuu. <verse eid="2SA 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15"/>Enti Dawid ne Israel nyinaa de nteɛteɛmu ne ntorobɛntohyɛn maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Adaka no so kɔe.<verse eid="2SA 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikal Ka Dawid Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16"/>Bere a wɔde <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Adaka no rewura Dawid Kuropɔn no mu no, Saulo babea a ne din de Mikal no kɔtɛwee mfɛnsere mu hwɛe. Ohuu sɛ ɔhene Dawid rehuruhuruw, resaw anigye so wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim no, nʼani annye.<verse eid="2SA 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17"/>Wɔde <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Adaka no kosii nʼafa wɔ ntamadan a ɛno nti, Dawid asi no mu, na Dawid bɔɔ ɔhyew afɔre ne asomdwoe afɔre wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. <verse eid="2SA 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18"/>Owiei no, ohyiraa nkurɔfo no wɔ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu. <verse eid="2SA 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19"/>Afei, ɔmaa Israel dɔm no mu onipa biara brodo mua, namkum ne bobe aba ɔfam. Na wɔn mu biara kɔɔ ne fi.<verse eid="2SA 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20"/>Bere a Dawid san kɔɔ ne fi sɛ ɔrekohyira ne fifo no, Mikal fii adi ba behyiaa no ka kyerɛɛ no abufuw so se, “Nnɛ de, na Israelhene nsɛ ha! Ɔpaa ne ho kyerɛɛ ne mfenaa te sɛ nea obiara a ommu ne ho bɛyɛ no ara pɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21"/>Dawid buaa Mikal se, “Na meresaw wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a oyii me, na otwaa wʼagya ne nʼabusuafo gyawee no anim. Oyii me sɛ menyɛ Israel a wɔyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkurɔfo ɔkannifo. Ɛno nti, ɛyɛ me pɛ sɛ meyɛ me ho sɛ ɔkwasea, sɛnea ɛbɛma makyerɛ mʼahokeka a mewɔ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mu. <verse eid="2SA 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22"/>Yiw, na mepɛ sɛ meyɛ ɔkwasea koraa sen eyi, na mmeawa koro yi ara a woreka wɔn ho asɛm yi bɛhyɛ me anuonyam.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23"/>Na Saulo babea Mikal anwo ba da wɔ ne nkwa nna nyinaa.<verse eid="2SA 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Hyɛ Dawid Bɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1"/>Bere a wɔbɔɔ ɔhene no atenase wɔ nʼahemfi na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama asomdwoe aba asase no so no, <verse eid="2SA 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2"/>Dawid frɛɛ odiyifo Natan se, “Hwɛ, mete ahemfi a wɔde sida asi mu, na Onyankopɔn Adaka no nso si ntamadan mu.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3"/>Na Natan buaa ɔhene no se, “Biribiara a woadwene ho sɛ wobɛyɛ no, kɔ so na yɛ, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka wo ho.”<verse eid="2SA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4"/>Na anadwo no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Natan se,<verse eid="2SA 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5"/>“Kɔka kyerɛ me somfo Dawid se, ‘Sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Wone obi a ɛsɛ sɛ wusi dan ma me na metena mu ana? <verse eid="2SA 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6"/>Efi bere a mede Israelfo fi Misraim bae de besi nnɛ no, mentenaa ɔdan mu da. Daa wotu mʼase fi baabi kɔ baabi. <verse eid="2SA 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7"/>Bere biara a wotu mʼase a Israelman nyinaa ka me ho no, motee sɛ mibisaa wɔn sodifo, wɔn a mehyɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnhwɛ me nkurɔfo Israelfo no se, “Adɛn nti na momfaa sida nsii ofi mmaa me da?” ’<verse eid="2SA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8"/>“Afei, kɔka kyerɛ me somfo Dawid se, ‘Sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: Miyii wo fii mmoa adidibea ne nguan akyidi mu, de wo besii me nkurɔfo Israel so hene. <verse eid="2SA 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9"/>Na baabiara a wokɔ no, meka wo ho, na matwa wʼatamfo nyinaa afi wʼanim. Na mɛma woagye din wɔ asase yi nyinaa so. <verse eid="2SA 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10"/>Na mama me nkurɔfo Israelfo no baabi a wɔbɛtena afebɔɔ. Beae bi a ɛwɔ bammɔ a obiara renhaw wɔn. Ɛhɔ bɛyɛ wɔn ankasa asase a aman amumɔyɛfo renhyɛ wɔn so, sɛnea wɔyɛɛ bere bi a atwa mu no, <verse eid="2SA 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11"/>efi bere a mepaw atemmufo sɛ wonni me nkurɔfo so no. Mɛsan ama mo bammɔ afi mo atamfo nyinaa nsam.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:11">“ ‘Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ wo se, ɔno <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔbɛkyekyere ofi ama wo; ahemfo ntoatoaso fi. <verse eid="2SA 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12"/>Na sɛ wo nna to twa a, mɛma wʼaseni a ofi wʼasen mu adi wʼade, na matim nʼaheman ase. <verse eid="2SA 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13"/>Ɔno ne obi a obesi dan de me din ato so. Na matim nʼaheman mu ahengua ase afebɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14"/>Mɛyɛ nʼagya, na wayɛ me Ba. Sɛ ɔyɛ bɔne a, mɛma aman bi atwe nʼaso. <verse eid="2SA 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15"/>Nanso, merenyi me dɔ mfi ne so da, sɛnea miyi fii Saulo a miyii no fii wʼanim no so ansa na wubedii nʼade no. <verse eid="2SA 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16"/>Wo fi ne wʼahenni betim wɔ mʼanim afebɔɔ; na wʼahengua betim daa nyinaa.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17"/>Enti Natan san kɔɔ Dawid nkyɛn kɔkaa nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka no nyinaa kyerɛɛ no.<verse eid="2SA 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Aseda Mpaebɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18"/>Na ɔhene Dawid kɔtenaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim bɔɔ mpae se,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:18">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> Tumfo, me ne hena, na me fifo yɛ dɛn a wode me abedu nnɛ? <verse eid="2SA 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19"/>Na afei Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, eyinom nyinaa akyi no, woka sɛ wobɛma me ahenni a ɛte hɔ daa. Woyɛ nnipa nyinaa sɛɛ ana, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Tumfo?<verse eid="2SA 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20"/>“Dɛn bio na metumi aka? Efisɛ wunim wʼakoa, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Tumfo. <verse eid="2SA 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21"/>Wʼasɛm ne wo pɛ mu nti, woayɛ nneɛma kɛse yi nyinaa akyerɛ wo somfo.<verse eid="2SA 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22"/>“Wo kɛseyɛ yɛ kokuroo, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Tumfo! Obiara nte sɛ wo, Onyankopɔn bi nni hɔ sɛ wo, na yɛntee onyame foforo bi mpo ho asɛm ɛ! <verse eid="2SA 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23"/>Ɔman bɛn na ɛwɔ asase yi so a ɛte sɛ Israel? Ɔman foforo bɛn na woayi no afi nkoasom mu de wɔn ayɛ wo man? Bere a wuyii wo nkurɔfo fii Misraim no, wugyee din. Woyɛɛ anwonwade a ɛyɛ hu de pam aman ne ahoni ahorow a na wɔyɛ akwanside ma wo nkurɔfo no. <verse eid="2SA 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24"/>Woasi wo nkurɔfo Israel sɛ wʼankasa wʼade afebɔɔ, na wo, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woabɛyɛ wɔn Nyankopɔn.<verse eid="2SA 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25"/>“Na afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Nyankopɔn, di bɔ a wohyɛ faa wʼakoa ne ne fi ho no so. Ma ɛnyɛ bɔhyɛ a ɛbɛtena hɔ daa, <verse eid="2SA 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26"/>na ama wo din akorɔn afebɔɔ. Na nnipa bɛka se, ‘Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ Israel so Nyankopɔn.’ Na ma wo somfo Dawid ahenni ase ntim wɔ wʼanim.<verse eid="2SA 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27"/>“Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, masi me bo abɔ saa mpae yi efisɛ woakyerɛ sɛ wobɛkyekye ofi a ɛyɛ daa ahenni ama me. <verse eid="2SA 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> Tumfo, woyɛ Onyankopɔn! Wo nsɛm mu wɔ ahotoso, na woahyɛ wo somfo nnepa ho bɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29"/>Afei, ma ɛnyɛ wo pɛ sɛ wubehyira wʼakoa fi so, na atoa so afebɔɔ wɔ wʼanim, na wo, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woakasa, na wo nhyira a wode behyira wo somfo fi no bɛyɛ daapem nhyira.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Akodi Mu Nkonimdi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1"/>Akyiri no, Dawid dii Filistifo no so, brɛɛ wɔn ase. Ɔko gyee Gat a ɛyɛ wɔn kuropɔn kɛse no.<verse eid="2SA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2"/>Dawid san dii Moabfo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Moabfo no yɛ Lot asefo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:37">1 Mose 19.37</ref></char>) a wɔtenaa Nkyene Po no apuei fam. Saa bere no na Saulo adi wɔn so dedaw (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 14:47">1 Sam 14.47</ref></char>). Bere a Dawid wɔ asutwa mu no, ɔmaa nʼabusuafo kɔtenaa Moab (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 22:3-4">1 Sam 22.3-4</ref></char>). Dawid agyanom fi Moab (<char style="xt"><ref loc="RUT 1:22">Rut 1.22</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 4:22">4.22</ref></char>).</char></note> so. Ɔmaa nnipa no dedaa fam, na ɔde hama susuw wɔn. Osusuw hama no abien a, na wakyerɛ sɛ wonkum saa nnipa no. Ɛnna osusuw hama no baako a, na wakyerɛ sɛ wonnyaa saa nkurɔfo no. Enti Moabfo a wonyaa wɔn ti didii mu no bɛyɛɛ Dawid asomfo a na afe biara woyi tow brɛ no.<verse eid="2SA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3"/>Dawid sɛe Rehob babarima Hadadeser a na odi hene wɔ Soba no akofo, bere a Hadadeser kɔɔ Asubɔnten Eufrate ho, pɛe sɛ ɔkɔhyɛ ne nniso mu den no. <verse eid="2SA 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4"/>Dawid kyeree ne nteaseɛnam apem, nteaseɛnamkafo mpem ason ne asraafo a wɔnam mpem aduonu. Dawid twitwaa nteaseɛnam apɔnkɔ no nyinaa nantin ntin, na ogyaw mu ɔha pɛ.<verse eid="2SA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5"/>Bere a Aramfo a wofi Damasko baa sɛ wɔrebɛboa Sobahene Hadadeser no, Dawid kum wɔn mu mpem aduonu. <verse eid="2SA 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6"/>Na ɔde asraafo a wɔyɛ bansifo kɔtenaa Damasko, maa Aramfo bɛyɛɛ Dawid nkurɔfo a na woyi tow brɛ no. Baabiara a Dawid bɛkɔ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma no di nkonim.<verse eid="2SA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7"/>Dawid de Hadadeser asraafo mpanyimfo sikakɔkɔɔ nkatabo no baa Yerusalem. <verse eid="2SA 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8"/>Ɔde Beta ne Berotai a na ɛyɛ Hadadeser nkurow no mu kɔbere bebree kaa ne ho kɔe.<verse eid="2SA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9"/>Bere a Hamathene Toi tee sɛ Dawid atɔre Hadadeser asraafo no ase pasaa no, <verse eid="2SA 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10"/>ɔsomaa ne babarima Yoram kɔɔ Dawid nkyɛn, kokyiaa no maa no mo. Na Hadadeser ne Toi yɛ atamfo fi teteete a wɔako atia wɔn ho wɔn ho mpɛn pii. Yoram kɔkyɛɛ Dawid nneɛma bebree a ɛyɛ, dwetɛ, sikakɔkɔɔ ne kɔbere mfrafrae.<verse eid="2SA 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11"/>Ɔhene Dawid too akyɛde no nyinaa din de maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a, dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ a onya fii aman bi a odii wɔn so no nyinaa ka ho. <verse eid="2SA 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12"/>Saa aman no ne Edom, Moab, Amon, Filistia, Amalek ne nea efi Sobahene Rehob babarima Hadadeser nkyɛn nso.<verse eid="2SA 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13"/>Eyi maa Dawid gyee din. Ɔsan nʼakyi kɔe no, okunkum Edomfo mpem dunwɔtwe wɔ Nkyene Bon mu. <verse eid="2SA 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14"/>Ɔde asraafo bansifo tuatuaa Edom nyinaa ano. Na Edomfo nyinaa bɛyɛɛ Dawid nkoa. Eyi yɛ nhwɛso foforo a ɛkyerɛɛ nkonim a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa Dawid dii wɔ baabiara a ɔkɔe no.<verse eid="2SA 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15"/>Dawid dii Israel nyinaa so hene, a wanhyɛ obiara so na wansisi obiara nso. <verse eid="2SA 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16"/>Seruia babarima Yoab na na ɔyɛ ɔsafohene. Ahilud babarima Yehosafat na na ɔyɛ adehye abakɔsɛmkyerɛwni. <verse eid="2SA 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17"/>Sadok<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sadok yɛ Eliesar aseni. Odii Dawid nokware na akyiri no, ɔsraa Salomo ngo sɛ onni Dawid ade sɛ ɔhene.</char></note> a na ɔyɛ Ahitub babarima ne Abiatar babarima Ahimelek na na wɔyɛ asɔfo. Na Seraia yɛ asennii kyerɛwfo. <verse eid="2SA 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18"/>Yehoiada babarima Benaia na na odi Keretifo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Keretifo ne Peletifo yɛ ahɔho asraafo a wɔbɔ wɔn paa ma wɔko. Keretifo no ase fi Krete na Peletifo no nso ase fi Filisti. Wɔtaa bɔ saa akuw abien yi din sɛ awɛmfo a wɔwɛn adehye.</char></note> ne Peletifo so, na Dawid mmabarima tua asɔfodɔm ano.<verse eid="2SA 8:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Yɛ Mefiboset Adɔe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1"/>Da bi, Dawid pɛɛ sɛ obehu sɛ obi aka wɔ Saulo fi ana. Efisɛ na wahyɛ Yonatan bɔ sɛ ɔbɛyɛ wɔn adɔe.<verse eid="2SA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2"/>Ɔfrɛɛ ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Siba a na anka ɔfra Saulo asomfo mu. Na ɔhene bisaa no se, “Wo na wɔfrɛ wo Siba no ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Obuaa no se, “Yiw, me ne Siba no.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3"/>Ɔhene no bisaa no se, “Obi aka wɔ Saulo fi ana? Sɛ ɛte saa a mepɛ sɛ mɛyɛ wɔn adɔe a efi Onyankopɔn wɔ ɔkwan biara a metumi so.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Siba buaa ɔhene se, “Yonatan babarima obubuafo bi da so wɔ hɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4"/>Ɔhene bisae se, “Ɔwɔ he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Siba buae se, “Ɔwɔ Amiel babarima Makir fi wɔ Lo-debar.”<verse eid="2SA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5"/>Na ɔhene Dawid ma wɔkɔfaa no fii Amiel babarima Makir fi wɔ Lo-debar, de no brɛɛ no.<verse eid="2SA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6"/>Ne din de Mefiboset, a ɔyɛ Yonatan babarima ne Saulo nena. Ɔbaa Dawid anim no, ɔde ahopopo kotow no, kae se, “Meyɛ wo somfo.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7"/>Dawid ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Nsuro, na nea ɛbɛyɛ biara no, esiane wʼagya Yonatan nti, mɛyɛ wo adɔe. Nsase a na ɛyɛ wo nena Saulo agyapade no nyinaa, mɛsan de ama wo, na woadidi me didipon so daa daa.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8"/>Mefiboset bɔɔ ne mu ase kae se, “Hena ne me, ɔkraman funu a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyɛ me saa adɔe yi?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9"/>Ɔhene frɛɛ ne somfo Siba, ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Mede biribiara a na ɛyɛ Saulo ne ne fifo agyapade no nyinaa ama wo wura Saulo nenabarima no. <verse eid="2SA 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10"/>Wo ne wo mmabarima ne mo asomfo na mobɛdɔw asase no, ayɛ so mfuw ama no, na wanya aduan ama ne fifo. Na Mefiboset de, ɔne me bɛtena mʼahemfi ha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:10">Na Siba a na ɔwɔ mmabarima dunum ne asomfo aduonu no buae se, <verse eid="2SA 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11"/>“Me wura pa, asɛm a woaka akyerɛ me no nyinaa, medi so.” Na efi saa bere no, Mefiboset ne Dawid didii daa te sɛnea ɔyɛ nʼasen mu ba.<verse eid="2SA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12"/>Na Mefiboset wɔ ɔba abarimaa bi a ne din de Mika. Na efi saa bere no, Siba fifo nyinaa bɛyɛɛ Mefiboset asomfo. <verse eid="2SA 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13"/>Na Mefiboset a ɔyɛ obubuafo no tu kɔɔ Yerusalem kɔtenaa ahemfi hɔ.<verse eid="2SA 9:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Di Amonfo So Nkonim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1"/>Akyiri no, Amonfo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amonfo yɛ nnipa a na wɔte nweatam a na ɛwɔ Yordan apuei fam no so.</char></note> hene Nahas wui. Ne babarima Hanun na odii nʼade sɛ ɔhene. <verse eid="2SA 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2"/>Dawid kae se, “Mɛyɛ Nahas babarima Hanun adɔe, sɛnea nʼagya yɛɛ me adɔe no.” Nʼagya wu nti, Dawid tuu abɔfo kɔɔ ne nkyɛn kɔmaa no hyɛden.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Bere a Dawid abɔfo baa Amonfo asase so no, <verse eid="2SA 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3"/>Amonfo atitiriw no kobisaa wɔn wura Hanun se, “Wugye di sɛ ba a Dawid somaa nʼabɔfo baa wo nkyɛn bɛmaa wo hyɛden no kyerɛ nidi ampa ara ana? Wunnye nni sɛ Dawid somaa wɔn akwansra so, sɛ wɔmmɛhwɛ wo kuropɔn na wɔabetu agu?” <verse eid="2SA 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4"/>Ɛno nti, Hanun kyeree Dawid abɔfo no, yii obiara abogyesɛ fa, twitwaa wɔn ntade to mfimfini hɔ, tutuu mu, na wogyaa wɔn kwan, ma wɔde animguase kɔe.<verse eid="2SA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5"/>Bere a wɔbɔɔ Dawid amanneɛ no, otuu abɔfo ma wokohyiaa mmarima no, efisɛ woguu wɔn anim ase yiye. Ɔhene ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Montena Yeriko kosi sɛ mo abogyesɛ befuw ansa na moasan aba.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6"/>Bere a Amonfo huu sɛ wɔahyɛ Dawid abufuw no, wɔkɔbɔɔ Aramfo asraafo mpem aduonu paa fii Bet-Rehob ne Soba. Saa ara na Maakahene nso maa wɔn mmarima apem fii ne nkyɛn, na Tob nso wonyaa mmarima mpem dumien. <verse eid="2SA 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7"/>Dawid tee saa no, ɔkaa Yoab ne akofo asraafo guu mu. <verse eid="2SA 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8"/>Amonfo no gyinaa wɔn kurow pon ano. Saa bere no na Aramfo a wofi Soba ne Rehob ne mmarima a wofi Tob ne Maaka no wɔ mfikyiri baabiara retwɛn ɔtamfo no.<verse eid="2SA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9"/>Bere a Yoab huu sɛ ɔrebɛko akofanu no, oyii asraafo a wɔyɛ nnam. Ɔno ara dii wɔn so safohene, dii wɔn anim, kɔko tiaa Aramfo no wɔ mfikyiri hɔ. <verse eid="2SA 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10"/>Ogyaw asraafo no nkae hɔ, de wɔn hyɛɛ ne nuabarima Abisai nsa sɛ ɔsafohene a ɔbɛkɔ akotua Amonfo no. <verse eid="2SA 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11"/>Yoab ka kyerɛɛ ne nuabarima no se, “Sɛ Aramfo no yɛ den dodo ma me a, ɛyɛ a, bɛboa me. Na sɛ Amonfo no nso yɛ den dodo ma wo a, me nso, mɛba abɛboa wo. <verse eid="2SA 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12"/>Ma wo bo nyɛ duru. Ma yɛnko akokoduru so mfa nnye yɛn nkurɔfo ne Onyankopɔn nkurow. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> pɛ nyɛ hɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13"/>Bere a Yoab ne nʼakofo no tow hyɛɛ Aramfo no so no, wofii ase guanee. <verse eid="2SA 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14"/>Na Amonfo no huu sɛ Aramfo no reguan no, woguan fii Abisai ho kɔhyɛɛ kurow no mu. Ɔko no gui no, Yoab san kɔɔ Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15"/>Afei, Aramfo no huu sɛ ɛnyɛ wɔn afɛ ne Israelfo. Enti wɔboaa wɔn ho ano bio. <verse eid="2SA 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16"/>Aram asraafo foforo bi bɛkaa wɔn ho a Hadadeser na ɔsoma ma wɔkɔfaa wɔn fii Asubɔnten Eufrate fa nohɔ bae. Saa asraafo no beduu Helam a Sobak na na ɔyɛ wɔn ɔsahene, na ɔyɛ ɔsahene a otua Hadadeser asraafo nyinaa ano nso.<verse eid="2SA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17"/>Bere a Dawid tee nea ɛreba no, ɔboaboaa Israel nyinaa ano, de wɔn twaa Asubɔnten Yordan, dii asraafo no anim, koduu Helam. Ɛhɔ na Aramfo no fifii wɔn mpasua so tow hyɛɛ Dawid so. <verse eid="2SA 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18"/>Nanso Aramfo no guan fii Israelfo no anim bio. Saa bere no, Dawid asraafo no kunkum nteaseɛnamkafo ahanson ne apɔnkɔsotefo mpem aduanan a Sobak a na ɔyɛ wɔn sahene no ka ho. <verse eid="2SA 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19"/>Bere a ahemfo a wɔhyɛ Hadadeser ase no huu sɛ Israel adi wɔn so nkonim no, wɔmaa wɔn nsa so, na wɔbɛyɛɛ Israelfo nkoa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:19">Ɛno akyi no, Aramfo suroo sɛ wɔbɛboa Amonfo.<verse eid="2SA 10:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Ne Batseba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1"/>Asusowbere a edi so no mu, bere a ɛsɛ sɛ ahemfo kɔ ɔsa no, Dawid somaa Yoab ne Israel asraafo nyinaa sɛ wɔnkɔsɛe Amonfo. Wokotuaa kuropɔn Raba ano, na Dawid de, ɔkaa Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2"/>Da bi anwummere a Dawid ayi nʼani so kakra no, ɔsɔre fii ne mpa so nantew faa nʼahemfi no atifi. Ogyina hɔ no, ohuu ɔbea bi sɛ ɔreguare. Na ɔbea no ho yɛ fɛ yiye; <verse eid="2SA 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3"/>na Dawid somaa obi sɛ onkobisa ne ho nsɛm. Ɔbarima no bɛkae se, “Ɛyɛ Eliam babea Batseba, a ɔyɛ Hetini Uria yere.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4"/>Na Dawid tuu abɔfo sɛ wɔnkɔfrɛ no mmrɛ no. Ɔbaa Dawid nkyɛn. Dawid ne no dae. (Odwiraa ne ho fii ne nsabu mu no, na ɛnkyɛe.) Afei, ɔsan kɔɔ fie. <verse eid="2SA 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5"/>Bere a Batseba huu sɛ wanyinsɛn no, ɔsoma ma wɔkɔka kyerɛɛ Dawid.<verse eid="2SA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6"/>Enti Dawid soma kɔɔ Yoab nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Fa Hetini Uria brɛ me.” <verse eid="2SA 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7"/>Bere a Uria duu Dawid nkyɛn no, obisaa gyinabea a Yoab ne asraafo no wɔ mu ne sɛnea ɔko no rekɔ so. <verse eid="2SA 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ Uria se, “Kɔ fie na kɔhome.” Na mpo, Uria fii ahemfi hɔ no, Dawid soma ma wɔde akyɛde bi kɔmaa no. <verse eid="2SA 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9"/>Nanso Uria ankɔ fie. Ɔne ɔhene asomfo no bi tenaa ahemfi pon no ano.<verse eid="2SA 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10"/>Bere a Dawid tee nea Uria ayɛ no, ɔfrɛɛ no bisaa no se, “Dɛn na ɛhaw wo? Wufii fie akyɛ na adɛn na woankɔ hɔ nnɛra anadwo?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11"/>Uria buae se, “Apam Adaka no ne Israel asraafo ne Yuda tete ntamadan mu, na Yoab nso ne ne mpanyimfo abɔ atenae wɔ wuram baabi petee mu. Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na matumi akɔ fie akɔnom nsa, adidi na me ne me yere akɔda? Meka ntam se merenyɛ eyi na madi ho fɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12"/>Na Dawid ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Eye, tena ha anadwo yi, na ɔkyena wobɛkɔ asraafo no mu.” Enti Uria tenaa Yerusalem da no ne nʼadekyee. <verse eid="2SA 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13"/>Na Dawid frɛɛ no adidi ne ɔnom aponto, na ɔmaa no nsa ma ɔbowee. Na ɛno mpo, Uria ankɔ fie ankohu ne yere. Ɔdaa ahemfi no kwan ano bio.<verse eid="2SA 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Hyehyɛ Uria Wu Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14"/>Ade kyee anɔpa no, Dawid kyerɛw krataa maa Uria sɛ ɔmfa nkɔma Yoab. <verse eid="2SA 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15"/>Krataa no mu nsɛm kyerɛɛ Yoab se, “Ma Uria nkɔ akono baabi a ɔko no ano yɛ den pa ara. Wo de, san wʼakyi, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, wobekum no.”<verse eid="2SA 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16"/>Enti Yoab maa Uria kogyinaa baabi a ɛbɛn kurow no fasu, a ɛhɔ na onim sɛ atamfo no mmarima a wɔyɛ den no reko. <verse eid="2SA 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17"/>Ɛhɔ na wokum Hetini Uria ne Israel asraafo no bebree.<verse eid="2SA 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18"/>Na Yoab de ɔsa mu amanneɛ kɔbɔɔ Dawid. <verse eid="2SA 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼabɔfo no se, “Monka ɔsa mu nsɛm no nyinaa nkyerɛ ɔhene. <verse eid="2SA 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20"/>Nanso ebia ne bo befuw, ama wabisa se, ‘Adɛn nti na asraafo no kɔbɛn kurow no pɛɛ saa? Na wonnim sɛ wɔbɛtow agyan afi afasu no mu? <verse eid="2SA 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21"/>Ɔbeabasia antow awiyammo ammɔ Gideon babarima Abimelek wɔ Tebes ankum no?’ Afei, monka nkyerɛ no se, wɔakum Hetini Uria nso.”<verse eid="2SA 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22"/>Enti abɔfo no kɔɔ Yerusalem kɔbɔɔ ɔsa no mu amanneɛ kyerɛɛ Dawid sɛnea Yoab somaa no sɛ ɔnkɔka no. <verse eid="2SA 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23"/>Abɔfo no ka kyerɛɛ Dawid se, “Mmarima no bu faa yɛn so, na wotiaa yɛn petee mu de, nanso yepiaa wɔn kɔɔ kurow no pon ano. <verse eid="2SA 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24"/>Ɛhɔ na agyantowfo tow wʼasomfo fii ɔfasu ho, maa ɔhene mmarima no bi wuwui. Na wo somfo Hetini Uria nso awu.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25"/>Dawid ka kyerɛɛ abɔfo no se, “Monka nkyerɛ Yoab se ɔmmma nʼaba mu mmu, na ɔko mu de obiara tumi wu. Monyere mo ho nko ɔkoden na munni kuropɔn no so nkonim.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26"/>Bere a Batseba tee sɛ ne kunu awu no, osuu no. <verse eid="2SA 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27"/>Na osu no akyi no, Dawid soma ma wɔkɔfaa no baa ne fi. Ɔbɛyɛɛ ne yere, na ɔwoo ɔbabarima. Na nea Dawid yɛe no ansɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani.<verse eid="2SA 11:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Natan Ka Dawid Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> somaa odiyifo Natan kɔɔ Dawid nkyɛn. Oduu hɔ no ɔkae se, “Na mmarima baanu bi te kurow bi so. Na mmarima no mu baako yɛ ɔdefo, na nea ɔka ho no nso yɛ ohiani. <verse eid="2SA 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2"/>Na ɔdefo no wɔ nguan ne anantwi bebree, <verse eid="2SA 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3"/>ohiani no de, na onni hwee ka oguan bere ketewa bi a ɔtɔɔ no no ho. Ɔyɛn no maa ɔne ɔno ankasa mma nyin bɔɔ mu. Na ɔne aboa no di nʼaduan, nom fi ne kuruwa mu, na nna mu nso, na daa ɔda nʼabasa so. Na ɔte sɛ ne babea.<verse eid="2SA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4"/>“Da koro bi, ɔhɔho bi baa ɔdefo no nkyɛn, nanso wankum ne nguan anaa ne nantwi annoa aduan amfa ansom no hɔho. Na mmom, ɔkɔkyeree ohiani no guanbere no, de yɛɛ aduan maa ɔhɔho a wabɛsoɛ no no.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5"/>Dawid tee asɛm no, ne bo fuw saa ɔbarima no yiye, na ɔka kyerɛɛ Natan se, “Mmere dodow a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, ɛfata sɛ ɔbarima a ɔyɛɛ saa no wu. <verse eid="2SA 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ otua oguan bere no ka mmɔ ho anan sɛ ɔyɛɛ bɔne saa a wannya ahummɔbɔ biara.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Natan ka kyerɛɛ Dawid se, “Wone saa ɔbarima no! <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Nyankopɔn, se, ‘Mesraa wo sɛ Israelhene, gyee wo fii Saulo tumi ase. <verse eid="2SA 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8"/>Mede ne fi ne ne yerenom ne Israel ne Yuda ahemman maa wo. Na sɛ na ɛno nnɔɔso a, anka mɛma wo bebree aka ho. <verse eid="2SA 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9"/>Adɛn nti na woabu Awurade asɛm animtiaa, na woayɛ bɔne a ɛte saa? Woakum Hetini Uria, awia ne yere. <verse eid="2SA 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10"/>Efi nnɛ rekɔ, afoa na ɛbɛyɛ ahunahunade ama wo fifo, efisɛ woabu me animtiaa, afa Hetini Uria yere de no ayɛ wo yere.’<verse eid="2SA 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11"/>“Esiane nea woayɛ yi nti, me <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mɛma wʼankasa fi mufo asɔre atia wo. Mede wo yerenom bɛma ɔbarima foforo, na ɔne wɔn bɛda ama obiara ahu. <verse eid="2SA 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12"/>Woyɛɛ eyi wɔ kokoa mu, nanso mɛma nea ɛreba wo so no ada gua, ama Israel nyinaa ahu.”<verse eid="2SA 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Gye Ne Bɔne To Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13"/>Na Dawid ka kyerɛɛ Natan se, “Mayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Natan buae se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi wo bɔne no afi wo so. Worenwu. <verse eid="2SA 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14"/>Nanso sɛ woama <char style="nd">Awurade</char> atamfo kwan sɛ wommu no animtiaa, ngu ne din ho fi nti, ɔba a wɔbɛwo no ama wo no bewu.”<verse eid="2SA 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15"/>Natan kɔɔ ne fi ara pɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa abofra a Uria yere Batseba wo maa Dawid no yaree denneennen. <verse eid="2SA 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16"/>Dawid srɛɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔmma abofra no ntena ase. Ɔkyen ho kɔm, na ɔkɔɔ fi, na anadwo mu no nyinaa, furaa atweaatam, daa fam tim. <verse eid="2SA 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17"/>Mpanyimfo a wɔwɔ ne fi srɛɛ no sɛ ɔnsɔre na ɔne wɔn nnidi, nanso wampene. <verse eid="2SA 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18"/>Ne nnanson so, abofra no wui. Na Dawid afotufo no suro sɛ wɔbɛbɔ no amanneɛ sɛ abofra no awu, efisɛ na wɔn adwene ne se, “Bere a na abofra no te ase no, yɛkasa kyerɛɛ Dawid, nanso wantie yɛn. Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na yɛatumi aka akyerɛ no se abofra no awu? Anhwɛ a, ɔbɛyɛ ne ho biribi.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19"/>Na Dawid huu sɛ nʼafotufo no reyɛ huhuhuhu no, ɔtee nka sɛ abofra no awu. Obisae se, “Abofra no awu ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Wobuae se, “Yiw, wawu.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20"/>Na Dawid sɔre fii fam hɔ. Afei, oguare wiee a ɔpetee ne ho aduhuam, na ɔsesaa ne ntade no, ɔkɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi kɔsɔree. Afei, ɔkɔɔ nʼankasa fi, na ɔno ankasa ka ma wɔbrɛɛ no aduan, na odidii.<verse eid="2SA 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21"/>Nʼafotufo no bisaa no se, “Nea woreyɛ yi, ase ne dɛn? Bere a abofra no te ase no, wudii mmuada, twaa agyaadwo. Na afei a wawu no mmom na woasɔre adidi!”<verse eid="2SA 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22"/>Obuae se, “Bere a na abofra no da so te ase no de, midii abuada, twaa agyaadwo. Medwenee sɛ, ‘Hena na onim? Ebia, Awurade behu me mmɔbɔ ama abofra no atena.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23"/>Na afei a wawu yi, adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ midi abuada? Metumi asan de no aba nkwa mu bio ana? Mɛkɔ ne nkyɛn da bi, na ɔno de, ɔrensan mma me nkyɛn ha da.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24"/>Na Dawid kyekyeree ne yere Batseba werɛ, na ɔne no dae. Onyinsɛnee, woo ɔbabarima, na wɔtoo no din Salomo. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> pɛɛ abofra no asɛm, <verse eid="2SA 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25"/>na ɔde asɛm faa odiyifo Natan so se, ɛsɛ sɛ abofra no din yɛ Yedidia, efisɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dɔ no.<verse eid="2SA 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Ko Fa Raba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26"/>Saa bere no, na Yoab ne Israel asraafo no ako afa Amon ahenkurow Raba no nnommum. <verse eid="2SA 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27"/>Yoab somaa abɔfo kɔɔ Dawid nkyɛn, kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Mako atia Raba, afa nea wonya wɔn nsu fi. <verse eid="2SA 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28"/>Afei, fa asraafo a wɔaka no bra na wonwie adwuma no, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, wubenya nkonimdi anuonyam no sen sɛ ɛbɛyɛ me de.”<verse eid="2SA 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29"/>Enti Dawid dii nʼakofo a wɔaka no anim kɔɔ Raba kɔfaa hɔ. <verse eid="2SA 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30"/>Dawid tuu ɔhene no ahenkyɛw, na nnipa no de hyɛɛ Dawid. Wɔde sikakɔkɔɔ na ɛyɛɛ ahenkyɛw no a aboɔdenmmo bobɔ mu a, na ɛkari nsania ani kilogram aduasa anan. Dawid fow asade bebree wɔ kuropɔn no mu. <verse eid="2SA 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31"/>Ɔsan faa nnipa a wɔwɔ Raba no sɛ nkoa, hyɛɛ wɔn, ma wɔde ɔwan, pinkase ne mmonnua yɛɛ adwuma wɔ ntayaa fononoo ho. Saa ara na ɔne nnipa a wɔwɔ Amon nkurow nyinaa so dii no. Na Dawid ne nʼakofo san kɔɔ Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Amnon To Tamar Mmonnaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1"/>Na Dawid babarima Absalom wɔ nuabea bi a na ne ho yɛ fɛ yiye. Na saa ɔbea no din de Tamar.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Tamar yɛ Maaka babea. Na Maaka yi yɛ Gesurhene babea (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 3:3">3.3</ref></char>). Amnon nso na ɔyɛ Ahinoam babarima. Na Ahinoam yɛ Dawid yere a odi kan na Amnon nso, na ɔyɛ Dawid abakan barima a amanne mu no, obedi ade daakye.</char></note> Na Amnon a ɔyɛ ne nuabarima no kɔn dɔɔ no.<verse eid="2SA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2"/>Amnon tuu nʼani sii Tamar so ara kosii sɛ ɛbɔɔ no yare. Na ɔyɛ ɔbabun nti, na na ɛyɛ sɛ Amnon rentumi nyɛ no hwee.<verse eid="2SA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3"/>Na Amnon wɔ adamfo onifirifo bi a wɔfrɛ no Yonadab. Na ɔyɛ Dawid nuabarima Simea babarima. <verse eid="2SA 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4"/>Da koro bi, Yonadab bisaa Amnon se, “Asɛm bɛn na aba? Adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔhene babarima yɛ bosaa anɔpa biara saa?” Na Amnon buaa no se, “Medɔ Tamar, Absalom nuabea no.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5"/>Yonadab kae se, “Eye, mɛkyerɛ wo nea wobɛyɛ. San kɔ na kɔda wo mpa so, na hyɛ da yɛ sɛnea woyare no. Sɛ wʼagya behu wo a, ka kyerɛ no se ɔnka nkyerɛ Tamar, na ɔmmɛyɛ aduan bi mma wo nni. Ka kyerɛ no se, sɛ ɔno brɛ wo aduan di a, wo ho bɛtɔ wo.”<verse eid="2SA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6"/>Enti Amnon patuw yaree. Na ɔhene no bɛsraa no no, Amnon ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Mesrɛ wo, ma Tamar mmɛhwɛ me, na ɔnnoa biribi mma minni.” <verse eid="2SA 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7"/>Dawid penee so, somaa Tamar kɔɔ Amnon fi, kɔnoaa aduan maa no.<verse eid="2SA 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8"/>Bere a Tamar duu Amnon fi hɔ no, ɔkɔɔ ɔdan a na ɔda mu no mu, sɛnea sɛ Tamar refɔtɔw asikresiam a obehu. Enti ɔtoo brodo sononko bi maa no. <verse eid="2SA 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9"/>Nanso ɔde aduan no guu apampaa so besii nʼanim no, wampɛ sɛ odi. Na Amnon ka kyerɛɛ nʼasomfo a wɔwɔ hɔ no se, “Obiara mfi ha nkɔ!” Enti wɔn nyinaa kɔe.<verse eid="2SA 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10"/>Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ Tamar se, “Fa aduan no brɛ me wɔ me pia mu, na bubu hyɛ mʼano.” Enti Tamar maa so de kɔɔ hɔ. <verse eid="2SA 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11"/>Na bere a ogu so de rema no no, ɔtow hyɛɛ ne so, na ɔkae se, “Wo ne me nna, me nuabea ɔdɔfo.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12"/>Na Tamar teɛɛ mu se, “Dabi da, onuabarima! Nyɛ saa amumɔyɛde yi! Nyɛ me saa! Wunim sɛ, sɛ woyɛ a, ɛyɛ bɔne kɛse wɔ Israel. <verse eid="2SA 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13"/>Na ɛhe na anka mede saa aniwu no bɛfa? Na wɔbɛka sɛ, wo nso woyɛ nkwaseafo akɛse a wɔwɔ Israel no mu baako. Mesrɛ wo, ka biribi kɛkɛ kyerɛ ɔhene, na ɔbɛma woaware me.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14"/>Nanso Amnon ampene so. Na esiane sɛ ɔwɔ ahoɔden sen Tamar nti, ɔtoo no mmonnaa.<verse eid="2SA 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Amnon dɔ no dan ɔtan. Ɔtan no mu yɛɛ den sen ɔdɔ a na ɔdɔ no no. Ɔteɛteɛɛ mu se, “Fi ha kɔ ntɛm!”<verse eid="2SA 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16"/>Tamar nso teɛteɛɛ mu se, “Dabi da. Sɛ worepam me afi ha mprempren no yɛ bɔne kɛse koraa sen nea woayɛ me dedaw no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Nanso Amnon ampɛ sɛ obetie no. <verse eid="2SA 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17"/>Ɔteɛɛ mu frɛɛ ne somfo hyɛɛ no se, “Pam saa ɔbea yi fi ha, na to pon no mu!” <verse eid="2SA 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18"/>Enti ɔsomfo no pam no. Na ɔhyɛ batakari tenten fɛfɛ bi sɛnea na amanne kyerɛ wɔ ɔhene babea a ɔyɛ ɔbabun ho no. <verse eid="2SA 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19"/>Nanso Tamar sunsuan ne batakari no mu, de nsõ guu ne ti mu. Afei, ɔde ne nsa kataa nʼani, de osu sii kwan so.<verse eid="2SA 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20"/>Ne nuabarima Absalom huu no bisaa no se, “Wo nuabarima Amnon ne wo ada ana? Yɛ dinn, me nuabea; ɔyɛ wo nuabarima. Mfa saa asɛm yi nhyɛ wo koma mu.” Na Tamar tenaa ase sɛ ankonam werɛhonibea wɔ Absalom fi.<verse eid="2SA 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21"/>Bere a ɔhene Dawid tee asɛm no, ne bo fuw yiye. <verse eid="2SA 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22"/>Absalom nso anka ho hwee ankyerɛ Amnon. Nanso ɔtan Amnon yiye, efisɛ wagu ne nuabea Tamar anim ase.<verse eid="2SA 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Absalom Tɔ Amnon So Were</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23"/>Mfe abien akyi, da koro bi a na wɔretwitwa Absalom nguan ho nwi wɔ Baal-Hasor a ɛbɛn Efraim hye so no, Absalom too nsa frɛɛ ɔhene mmabarima nyinaa sɛ wɔmmra hɔ. <verse eid="2SA 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24"/>Absalom kɔɔ ɔhene nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Me nguan nwitwitwafo reyɛ adwuma. Ɔhene ne nʼasomfo bɛba abɛka me ho ana?”<verse eid="2SA 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25"/>Ɔhene buae se, “Dabi, me ba. Ɛnsɛ sɛ yɛn nyinaa kɔ; yɛbɛyɛ ɔhaw ama wo.” Ɛwɔ mu sɛ Absalom hyɛɛ no de, nanso wampene sɛ ɔbɛkɔ, na ohyiraa no kosɛkosɛ.<verse eid="2SA 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26"/>Na Absalom kae se, “Sɛ saa na ɛte de a, ma me nuabarima Amnon mmɛka yɛn ho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Ɔhene no bisaa no se, “Adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔbɛka mo ho?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27"/>Nanso ɔhyɛɛ no nti, ɔmaa Amnon ne ahenemma no nyinaa bɛkaa ne ho.<verse eid="2SA 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28"/>Absalom ka kyerɛɛ ne nkurɔfo no se, “Muntie! Montwɛn na Amnon mmow nsa, na afei mɛyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnne na moakum no. Munnsuro. Me ara na mahyɛ mo sɛ monyɛ saa. Momfa akokoduru nyɛ.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29"/>Enti Absalom mmarima no yɛɛ Amnon saa, sɛnea Absalom hyɛɛ wɔn no. Afei, ahene mmabarima no nyinaa sɔre tenatenaa wɔn mfurum so, na woguanee.<verse eid="2SA 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30"/>Bere a wɔresan akɔ Yerusalem no, saa asɛm yi duu Dawid asom se, “Absalom akunkum wo mmabarima no nyinaa a anka ɔbaako koraa.” <verse eid="2SA 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31"/>Ɔhene no huruw sii fam, sunsuan nʼatade mu, daa fam. Nʼafotufo nyinaa de ahodwiriw ne awerɛhow sunsuan wɔn ntade mu, dedaa fam saa ara.<verse eid="2SA 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32"/>Nanso ankyɛ biara na Yonadab a ɔyɛ Dawid nuabarima Simea babarima no beduu hɔ kae se, “Dabi, ɛnte saa. Ɛnyɛ wo mma no nyinaa na wɔakunkum wɔn. Amnon nko ara na wɔakum no. Efi bere a Amnon too ne nuabea Tamar mmonnaa no, na Absalom yɛɛ nʼadwene saa. <verse eid="2SA 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33"/>Dabi, wo mma no nyinaa nwuwui saa. Ɛyɛ Amnon nko ara.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34"/>Saa bere no, na Absalom aguan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Ɔwɛmfo a ɔwɔ Yerusalem fasu so no huu sɛ dɔm kɛse fi atɔe fam reba kurow no mu. Otuu mmirika kɔbɔɔ ɔhene amanneɛ se, “Mahu sɛ dɔm fi Horonaim kwan a ɛda bepɔw no nkyɛn mu hɔ no so reba.”<verse eid="2SA 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35"/>Yonadab ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no se, “Wɔn na wɔreba no! Wo mma no reba sɛnea mekae no.”<verse eid="2SA 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36"/>Ankyɛ na wobedui a, wɔretwa adwo, tew nisu, na ɔhene ne ne mpanyimfo nso twaa agyaadwo.<verse eid="2SA 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37"/>Na Dawid suu ne babarima Amnon nna bebree. Na Absalom guan kɔɔ ne nena barima Talmai a na ɔyɛ Amihud a na ɔyɛ ɔhene Gesur no babarima nkyɛn.<verse eid="2SA 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38"/>Ɔkɔtenaa Gesur hɔ mfe abiɛsa. <verse eid="2SA 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39"/>Na Dawid a afei wagyae Amnon wu no ho asɛm no pɛɛ sɛ ɔne ne babarima Absalom san ka bɔ mu.<verse eid="2SA 13:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Absalom San Ba Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1"/>Na Yoab huu sɛ ɔhene pɛ sɛ ohu Absalom. <verse eid="2SA 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2"/>Enti ɔsoma ma wɔkɔɔ Tekoa kɔfaa ɔbea nyansafo bi a wagye din yiye brɛɛ no. Yoab ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Hyɛ da yɛ wo ho sɛ wowɔ ayi mu, na fura ayitam. Nguare anaa mfa aduhuam mpete wo ho nso. Yɛ wo ho sɛ ɔbea a wadi awerɛhow nna bebree. <verse eid="2SA 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3"/>Na kɔ ɔhene nkyɛn kɔka asɛm a merebɛka akyerɛ wo yi kyerɛ no.” Na Yoab kaa asɛm a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔbea no kɔka no kyerɛɛ no.<verse eid="2SA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4"/>Na Tekoani bea no duu ɔhene no anim no, ɔhwee fam de nʼanim butuw fam teɛɛ mu se, “Ao Nana! Boa me!”<verse eid="2SA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5"/>Ɔhene no bisaa no se, “Ɛyɛ asɛm bɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Obuaa no se, “Meyɛ okunafo. <verse eid="2SA 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6"/>Me mma baanu twaa wɔn ho koe, a na obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛpata wɔn. Ɔbaako bɔɔ ɔbaako kum no. <verse eid="2SA 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7"/>Nanso abusua no nkae no kae se, ‘Ma yɛn nsa nka wo ba no a okum ne nua no na yenkum no bi na wammedi agyapade so.’ Na sɛ meyɛ saa nso a, na minni obiara a waka, na me kunu din ne me fi bɛyera wɔ asase so ha.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8"/>Ɔhene ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Gyae asɛm no ma me. Kɔ fie na mɛhwɛ sɛ obiara remfa ne nsa nka no.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9"/>Ɔkae se, “Me wura, meda wo ase. Mmoa a wode ama me yi nti, sɛ obi kasa tia wo a, mɛfa ho sobo no.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10"/>Ɔhene no kae se, “Mma eyi nhaw wo. Sɛ nnipa bi mpene a, fa wɔn brɛ me wɔ ha. Na metumi ama wo awerehyɛmu sɛ, obiara renwiinwii wɔ ho bio.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11"/>Afei, ɔbea no kae se, “Fa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn, no din ka ntam kyerɛ me sɛ, woremma obiara ntɔ me babarima no so were. Menhwehwɛ mogyahwiegu bio.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Ɔhene no nso kae se, “Mmere dodow a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, wo ba no tinwi a ɛwɔ ne ti so mu baako mpo ho renka.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12"/>Afei, ɔbea no kae se, “Ma wo somfo nka biribi nkyerɛ me wura ɔhene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Obuae se, “Kɔ so kasa.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13"/>Ɔbea no bisae se, “Adɛn nti na wonyɛ mma Onyankopɔn nkurɔfo sɛnea wɔahyɛ bɔ sɛ wobɛyɛ ama me no. Woabu wo ho fɔ sɛ woasi saa gyinae yi. Wompɛ sɛ woma wʼankasa wo ba a wɔatwa no asu no ba fie. <verse eid="2SA 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14"/>Nea ɛte biara no, obiara bewu. Na sɛnea nsu hwie gu fam a wosesaw a ɛnyɛ yiye no, saa ara na nkwa te. Ɛno nti na Onyankopɔn san de yɛn ba ne nkyɛn bere a yɛatew yɛn ho afi ne ho no. Wɔn a ɔhwɛ wɔn no, ɔmma wɔnnhwere wɔn kra; enti wo nso, ɛnsɛ sɛ woyɛ saa.<verse eid="2SA 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15"/>“Na maba sɛ merebedi ama me babarima, efisɛ wɔde owu hunahuna me ne me ba no. Meka kyerɛɛ me ho se, ‘Ebia, ɔhene betie me, <verse eid="2SA 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16"/>na wagye yɛn afi wɔn a wobetwa yɛn afi Onyankopɔn nkurɔfo ho no nsam.’<verse eid="2SA 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17"/>“Yiw, ɔhene no bɛma yɛn asomdwoe bio. ‘Minim sɛ wote sɛ Onyankopɔn bɔfo a wubetumi ahu papa ne bɔne ntam nsonoe. <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn, nka wo ho.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18"/>Ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ ɔbea no se, “Mepɛ sɛ mihu ade baako; mfa nhintaw me.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Ɔbea no kae se, “Ɛyɛ dɛn asɛm, me wura?”<verse eid="2SA 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19"/>“Yoab na ɔsomaa wo ha ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Ɔbea no buae se, “Me wura, Daasebrɛ, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na matwa eyi ho atoro? Obiara ntumi mfa biribiara nhintaw wo. Ɛyɛ nokware sɛ Yoab na ɔsomaa me, na ɔkyerɛɛ me asɛm a menka. <verse eid="2SA 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20"/>Ɔyɛɛ saa, sɛnea mɛfa ɔkwan foforo so de saa asɛm yi ato wʼanim. Na wo nso, wunim nyansa te sɛ Onyankopɔn bɔfo, na biribiara a esi yɛn ntam ha no nso, wote ase.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21"/>Enti ɔhene no soma ma wɔkɔfaa Yoab bae, na ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Eye, kɔ na kɔfa aberante Absalom bra.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22"/>Yoab hwee ɔhene no nan ase, hyiraa no se, “Ne korakora mu no, woapene me so, na woayɛ mʼabisade ama me.”<verse eid="2SA 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23"/>Na Yoab kɔɔ Gesur kɔfaa Absalom baa Yerusalem. <verse eid="2SA 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24"/>Nanso ɔhene hyɛe se, “Absalom tumi kɔ ɔno ankasa ne fi, nanso ɔnhwɛ na wamma mʼanim ha.” Enti Absalom anhu ɔhene no.<verse eid="2SA 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Absalom Ne Dawid Nkabom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25"/>Israel nyinaa, na obiara nni hɔ a ne ho yɛ fɛ, te sɛ Absalom. Efi ne ti so kosi ne nan ase, na wuhu sɛ ɔyɛ ɔbarima ankasa. <verse eid="2SA 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26"/>Afe biara, na oyi ne ti pɛnkoro, efisɛ ne nwi no yɛ adesoa ma no. Na sɛ oyi na ɔkari a, na ɛyɛ kilogram abien ne fa.<verse eid="2SA 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27"/>Na ɔwɔ mmabarima baasa ne ɔbabea baako. Na ne babea no din de Tamar. Na Tamar nso wɔ ahoɔfɛ a ɛmma ɔka.<verse eid="2SA 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28"/>Absalom tenaa Yerusalem mfe abien a wanhu ɔhene no da. <verse eid="2SA 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29"/>Afei, Absalom soma kɔfrɛɛ Yoab sɛ ɔnkɔka bi mma no, nanso Yoab ankɔ. Absalom somaa ne mprenu so, nanso Yoab ankɔ. <verse eid="2SA 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30"/>Ɛno nti, Absalom ka kyerɛɛ nʼasomfo se, “Monkɔ na momfa ogya nkɔto Yoab atokofuw a ɛbɛn me de no ho mu.” Na wɔde ogya kɔtoo afuw no mu, sɛnea Absalom hyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ no.<verse eid="2SA 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31"/>Na Yoab baa Absalom nkyɛn bebisaa no se, “Adɛn nti na wʼasomfo akɔto mʼafuw mu gya?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32"/>Na Absalom buaa no se, “Efisɛ na mepɛ sɛ wukobisa ɔhene ma me sɛ, adɛn nti na ɔmaa me san fii Gesur bae, nanso ɔmpɛ sɛ ohu mʼanim koraa? Ɛno de, sɛ anka metenaa me dedaw mu hɔ ara a, anka eye. Ma minhu ɔhene no, na sɛ midi fɔ wɔ biribi ho a, otumi kum me.”<verse eid="2SA 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33"/>Enti Yoab kaa asɛm a Absalom aka akyerɛ no no kyerɛɛ ɔhene no. Afei, Dawid frɛɛ ne ba a watew ne ho no, ma ɔbaa nʼanim. Absalom beduu ɔhene no anim no, ɔbɔɔ ne mu ase, na Dawid few nʼano.<verse eid="2SA 14:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Absalom Atuatew</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1"/>Eyi akyi no, Absalom tɔɔ teaseɛnam ne apɔnkɔ, na ɔbɔɔ mmarima aduonum paa sɛ wobedi nʼanim. <verse eid="2SA 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2"/>Adekyee biara, ɔsɔre ntɛm na wakɔtena kuropɔn no pon ano. Na sɛ nnipa bi de asɛm bɛto ɔhene no anim sɛ ommu ho atɛn a, Absalom bebisa faako a wofi, na wɔakyerɛ abusuakuw a wofi mu. <verse eid="2SA 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3"/>Na Absalom bɛka se, “Wʼasɛm yɛ dɛ de, nanso ɔhene nni obiara a obetie. <verse eid="2SA 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4"/>Sɛ meyɛ otemmufo anka mepɛ. Anka nnipa de wɔn nsɛm bɛba mʼanim, na mabu wɔn atɛn.”<verse eid="2SA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5"/>Sɛ nnipa pɛ sɛ wɔkotow no a, Absalom remma wɔn nyɛ saa na mmom obeso wɔn nsa, ayɛ wɔn atuu. <verse eid="2SA 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6"/>Absalom yɛɛ saa de nyaa Israelfo no nyinaa wɔ nʼafa.<verse eid="2SA 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7"/>Mfirihyia anan akyi no, Absalom ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no se, “Ma menkɔ Hebron na menkɔbɔ afɔre mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛnea mahyɛ no bɔ no. <verse eid="2SA 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8"/>Bere a na mewɔ Gesur no na mehyɛɛ saa bɔ no se, ‘Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de me san ba Yerusalem a, mɛbɔ afɔre ama no wɔ Hebron.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9"/>Ɔhene no kae se, “Eye, kɔ na kodi wo bɔhyɛ so.” Enti Absalom kɔɔ Hebron.<verse eid="2SA 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10"/>Bere a ɔwɔ hɔ no, ɔfaa sum ase somaa abɔfo kɔɔ Israel mmaa nyinaa kɔhwanyan ɔmanfo de tiaa ɔhene no. Ne nkra ne se, “Sɛ mote torobɛnto nne pɛ a, monka se, ‘Absalom adi hene wɔ Hebron.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11"/>Absalom faa mmarima ahannu fii Yerusalem kaa ne ho a na wonnim Absalom nsusuwii yi ho hwee. <verse eid="2SA 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12"/>Bere a Absalom rebɔ afɔre no, ɔsoma ma wɔkɔfaa Giloni Ahitofel a na ɔyɛ Dawid fotufo fi ne kurom Gilo bae. Enti pɔwbɔ no mu yɛɛ den na nnipa bebree no ara bɛkaa Absalom ho.<verse eid="2SA 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Guan Fi Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13"/>Ankyɛ, ɔbɔfo bi baa Yerusalem bɛka kyerɛɛ ɔhene Dawid se, “Israel nyinaa atu di Absalom akyi sɛ wɔayɛ adɔm atia wo.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Dawid ka kyerɛɛ ne mmarima se, “Monyɛ no ntɛm na yenguan mfi ha, ansa na wadu ha, sɛnea amanehunu bɛpare yɛn ne Yerusalem kurow mu no nyinaa.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15"/>Nʼafotufo no buae se, “Yegyina wʼakyi. Biribiara a wugye di sɛ eye no, yɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16"/>Enti ɔhene no ne ne fifo sii mu kɔɔ prɛko pɛ a wannyaw biribiara wɔ akyi sɛ ne mpenanom du bi a wɔbɛhwɛ nʼahemfi no so. <verse eid="2SA 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17"/>Ɔhene no ne ne nkurɔfo no faa fam, na wɔfaa kuropɔn no fa bi, <verse eid="2SA 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18"/>maa Dawid asraafo no betwaa wɔn ho dii wɔn anim. Nnipa a wɔkaa Dawid ho kɔe no yɛ Gitifo ahansia a wofi Gat a ne bammɔfo nso ka ho.<verse eid="2SA 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19"/>Na ɔhene no bisaa Gatni Itai a ɔyɛ ɔsafohene no se, “Adɛn nti na woka yɛn ho rekɔ? San kɔka wo nkurɔfo ho, na monkɔ ɔhene Absalom nkyɛn, efisɛ woyɛ ɔhɔho wɔ Israel ne ɔmamfrani a wɔatwa wo asu. <verse eid="2SA 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20"/>Wuduu ha nnɛra nko ara. Na ɛsɛ sɛ mehyɛ wo na wo ne yɛn kyin ana? Me mpo, minnim baabi a yɛbɛkɔ. San wʼakyi na kɔfa wo asraafo ka wo ho, na Awurade nkyerɛ wo ne dɔ ne ne nokware.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21"/>Nanso Itai ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no se, “Mede <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din ne wo ara wo nkwa ka ntam se, baabiara a wobɛkɔ no, mɛkɔ bi a nea ebesi biara mfa me ho; sɛ ɛyɛ nkwa anaa owu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22"/>Dawid buaa no se, “Eye, ka yɛn ho.” Ɛno nti, Itai ne ne mmarima ahansia ne wɔn fifo kaa wɔn ho kɔe.<verse eid="2SA 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23"/>Awerɛhow kɛse sii asase no so, bere a ɔhene ne nʼakyidifo retwa mu no. Wotwaa Kidron Bon no de wɔn ani kyerɛɛ sare so.<verse eid="2SA 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24"/>Abiatar ne Sadok ne Lewifo no faa Apam Adaka no, na wɔde sii kwankyɛn. Na wɔbɔɔ afɔre wɔ hɔ kosii sɛ obiara senee.<verse eid="2SA 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25"/>Na ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ Sadok se, “San fa Onyankopɔn Adaka no kɔ kuropɔn no mu. Sɛ minya <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim adom a, ɔbɛsan de me aba ama mahu Adaka no ne ne ntamadan no bio. <verse eid="2SA 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26"/>Nanso sɛ ɔka se, ‘Mʼani nnye wo ho’ a mepɛ, ma ɔmfa me mfa ɔkwan a onim sɛ eye ma no no so.”<verse eid="2SA 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27"/>Na ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ ɔsɔfo Sadok se, “Me nhyehyɛe ni: Wo ne Abiatar nyɛ komm nsan nkɔ kuropɔn no mu a wo babarima Ahimaas ne Yonatan a ɔyɛ Abiatar babarima ka ho. <verse eid="2SA 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28"/>Mɛtwɛn wɔ faako a wotwa Asubɔnten Yordan kɔ sare no so hɔ akosi sɛ mɛte mo nkra. Momma mente asɛm a ebesi wɔ Yerusalem, ansa na makɔ sare so.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29"/>Enti Sadok ne Abiatar faa Onyankopɔn Adaka no de san kɔɔ Yerusalem, na wɔtenaa hɔ.<verse eid="2SA 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30"/>Dawid faa ɔkwan a ɛkɔ Ngo Bepɔw so no so a ɔrekɔ no nyinaa, na ɔretwa adwo. Na wakata ne ti so, na ne nan sisi fam saa ara a ɛkyerɛ awerɛhowdi. Na nnipa a wɔka ne ho no nso katakataa wɔn ti so, twaa adwo bere a wogu so reforo bepɔw no. <verse eid="2SA 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31"/>Bere a obi ka kyerɛɛ Dawid se, afei de ne fotufo Ahitofel taa Absalom akyi no, Dawid bɔɔ mpae se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ma Ahitofel afotu nnan nkwaseasɛm.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32"/>Woduu Ngo Bepɔw no atifi baabi a nnipa som Onyankopɔn no, Dawid huu Husai a ofi Arki a ɔretwɛn no. Na Husai asunsuan nʼatade mu, de dɔte asra ne tirim, de kyerɛ awerɛhowdi. <verse eid="2SA 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33"/>Na Dawid ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Sɛ wo ne me kɔ a, wobɛyɛ adesoa ama me. <verse eid="2SA 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34"/>San kɔ Yerusalem, na ka kyerɛ Absalom se, ‘Afei, mɛyɛ wo fotufo sɛnea da bi hɔ no na meyɛ wʼagya fotufo no.’ Ɛba saa a, wubetumi atia Ahitofel afotu mu, asɛe no. <verse eid="2SA 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35"/>Asɔfo Sadok ne Abiatar wɔ hɔ. Ka adwene a wɔafa wɔ me ho, pɛ sɛ wɔkyere me no kyerɛ wɔn, <verse eid="2SA 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36"/>na wɔbɛsoma wɔn mmabarima Ahimaas ne Yonatan na wɔabɛhwehwɛ me, aka nea ɛrekɔ so akyerɛ me.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37"/>Enti Dawid adamfo Husai san kɔɔ Yerusalem, koduu hɔ bere koro a Absalom nso duu hɔ no mu.<verse eid="2SA 15:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Ne Siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1"/>Dawid sian bepɔw no pɛ na ɔne Mefiboset somfo Siba hyiae. Na ɔwɔ mfurum abien a wɔahyehyɛ brodo mua ahannu, bobe aba a wɔabɔ no atɔwatɔw ɔha ne nsa nhoma kotoku ma wɔ wɔn so. <verse eid="2SA 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2"/>Ɔhene no bisaa Siba se, “Na eyinom nso ɛ?” Na Siba buae se, “Mfurum no, mo nkurɔfo ntena wɔn so, na brodo no ne aduaba no, wɔmfa mma mmerante no na wonni. Na nsa no nso, momfa nkɔ sare so hɔ, na wɔn a ɔbrɛ nti wɔbɛtɔ beraw no anom.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3"/>Na ɔhene no bisaa no se, “Na Mefiboset wɔ he?” Siba buae se, “Ɔkaa Yerusalem. Ɔkae se, ‘Nnɛ, mɛsan agye me nena Saulo ahemman no.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4"/>Ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ Siba se, “Sɛ saa na ɛte de a, mede biribiara a ɛyɛ Mefiboset dea no rema wo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Siba buae se, “Meda wo ase awura. Bere biara, biribiara a wobɛka akyerɛ me sɛ menyɛ no, mɛyɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Simei Dome Dawid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5"/>Bere a ɔhene Dawid ne ne nkurɔfo retwa mu wɔ Bahurim no, ɔbarima bi pue fii akuraa no ase bɛdomee wɔn. Na saa ɔbarima no din de Simei, Gera a ɔyɛ Saulo busuani babarima. <verse eid="2SA 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6"/>Ɔpaa Dawid ne ne mpanyimfo ne asraafo a wɔatwa wɔn ho ahyia no nyinaa abo. <verse eid="2SA 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7"/>Ɔteɛɛ mu guu Dawid so se, “Fi ha kɔ! Mogyapɛfo a ɔte sɛ wo! Ohuhuni! <verse eid="2SA 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> atua wo ka sɛ wuhwiee Saulo ne ne fifo mogya gui. Wuwiaa nʼahengua, na afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ahemman no ahyɛ wo babarima Absalom nsa. Wobɛnom wʼankasa wʼaduru, mogyapɛfo.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9"/>Na Seruia babarima Abisai bisaa ɔhene no se, “Adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔkraman funu yi tumi dome me wura ɔhene? Ma menkɔ na minkotwa ne ti.”<verse eid="2SA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10"/>Nanso ɔhene no kae se, “Dɛn na me ne mo Seruia mmabarima bɛyɛ? Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ no se, ɔnnome me a, me ne hena a metumi aka akyerɛ no se onnyae?”<verse eid="2SA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11"/>Na Dawid ka kyerɛɛ Abisai ne ne mpanyimfo se, “Me babarima a ɔyɛ mʼankasa mogya pɛ sɛ okum me. Na dɛn na esiw Saulo busuani ho kwan sɛ ɔnyɛ saa ara. Munnyaa no, momma ɔnnome, efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na waka akyerɛ no se ɔnyɛ saa. <verse eid="2SA 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12"/>Ebia <char style="nd">Awurade</char> behu sɛ wɔreyɛ me bɔne, na ɔde papa atua me nnome a me nsa aka no nnɛ yi no so ka.”<verse eid="2SA 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13"/>Enti Dawid ne ne mmarima toaa so kɔɔ wɔn kwan a saa bere no, na Simei nso nam bepɔw bi a ɛbɛn wɔn so. Ɔrekɔ no nyinaa, na ɔredome, totow abo bɔ Dawid, tu mfutuma gu wim. <verse eid="2SA 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14"/>Ɔhene ne ne nkurɔfo nyinaa brɛɛ wɔ ɔkwan so nti, woduu Asubɔnten Yordan ho no, wogyee wɔn ahome.<verse eid="2SA 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahitofel Ma Absalom Afotu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15"/>Absalom ne Israel mmarima nyinaa baa Yerusalem a Ahitofel ka wɔn ho. <verse eid="2SA 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16"/>Na Husai a ofi Arki a ɔyɛ Dawid adamfo no, kɔɔ Absalom nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Ɔhene nkwa so! Ɔhene nkwa so!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17"/>Na Absalom bisaa Husai se, “Eyi ne ɔkwan a wode wʼadamfo Dawid fa so? Adɛn nti na wo ne wʼadamfo ankɔ?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18"/>Husai ka kyerɛɛ Absalom se, “Mewɔ ha efisɛ meyɛ adwuma ma ɔbarima a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne Israel ayi no. <verse eid="2SA 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19"/>Nea ɛka ho bio ne sɛ, hena na ɛsɛ sɛ mesom no? Sɛnea mesom wʼagya no, saa ara na mɛsom wo.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20"/>Absalom dan ne ho bisaa Ahitofel se, “Dɛn bio na menyɛ?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21"/>Ahitofel buaa no se, “Kɔ na wo ne wʼagya mpenanom no nna, efisɛ wagyaw wɔn hɔ sɛ wɔnhwɛ ahemfi hɔ. Ɛno bɛma Israel nyinaa ahu sɛ, woabu no animtiaa a ɛboro nkabom so, na wɔde wɔn ho bɛma wo.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22"/>Enti wosii ntamadan wɔ ahemfi no atifi baabi a obiara behu, na Absalom kɔɔ ntamadan no mu, na ɔne nʼagya mpenanom no dae.<verse eid="2SA 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23"/>Absalom tiee Ahitofel afotu sɛnea Dawid yɛe no pɛpɛɛpɛ. Na asɛm biara a efi Ahitofel anom bae no mu nyansa no yɛɛ sɛnea efi Onyankopɔn anom.<verse eid="2SA 16:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1"/>Ahitofel ka kyerɛɛ Absalom se, “Meyi asraafo mpem dumien, na mafi ha anadwo yi akɔtaa Dawid. <verse eid="2SA 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2"/>Mɛto no wɔ bere a ɔbrɛ nti, nʼaba mu abu. Ɔne nʼakofo nyinaa bɛbɔ hu na wɔaguan. Ɔhene no nko ara na mɛbɔ no ahwe, <verse eid="2SA 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3"/>na mede nnipa no asan abrɛ wo. Onipa a wohwehwɛ no no wu bɛma wɔn nyinaa asan aba; nnipa no mu biara ho rentɔ kyima.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4"/>Saa nhyehyɛe yi sɔɔ Absalom ne Israel mpanyimfo nyinaa ani.<verse eid="2SA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Husai Tia Ahitofel Afotu Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5"/>Nanso Absalom kae se, “Momfrɛ Husai a ofi Arki no mmra na yentie nea ɔwɔ ka.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6"/>Husai bae no, Absalom kaa nea Ahitofel aka no kyerɛɛ no. Afei obisaa no se, “Wʼadwene ne dɛn? Yɛmfa Ahitofel afotu no ana? Na sɛ ɛnte saa a, kyerɛ yɛn wʼadwene.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7"/>Husai buaa Absalom se, “Afotu a Ahitofel ama wo no nnye saa bere yi. <verse eid="2SA 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8"/>Wunim wʼagya ne ne dɔm; wɔyɛ akofo akɛse, na wɔn ho yɛ hu sɛ sisi a wɔawia ne mma. Ɛno da nkyɛn a, wʼagya nim de wɔ akodi mu; ɔne nʼakofo no rentena anadwo yi. <verse eid="2SA 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9"/>Sesɛɛ mpo, wakɔtɛw ɔbodan bi mu anaa baabi foforo. Na sɛ odi kan tow hyɛ mo so a, nea ɔbɛte biara no bɛka se, ‘Wɔakunkum asraafo a wodi Absalon akyi no.’ <verse eid="2SA 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10"/>Na sɛ ɛba saa a, ɔsraani a ɔyɛ nnam a ne koma te sɛ gyata no koraa, ehu bɛma wabɔ hu. Na Israel nyinaa nim sɛ wʼagya yɛ ɔkofo, na wɔn a wɔka ne ho no nso koko yɛ duru.<verse eid="2SA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11"/>“Enti mitu wo fo sɛ, boa Israel nyinaa ano, efi Dan kosi Beer-Seba. Woyɛ saa a wubenya asraafo a wɔn dodow bɛyɛ sɛ mpoano nwea. Na migye di sɛ wʼankasa bedi asraafo no anim. <verse eid="2SA 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12"/>Na sɛ yehu Dawid a, yɛbɛtow ahyɛ no so, sɛnea obosu gu asase so, a ɔno ne mmarima no mu baako mpo nka. <verse eid="2SA 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13"/>Na sɛ Dawid aguan kɔ kuropɔn bi so a, wode Israel asraafo nyinaa bɛkɔ hɔ. Afei, yebetumi afa ntampehama de atwe kurow no afasu, akogu obon a ɛbɛn mu, kosi sɛ ɔbo biara a ɛwɔ mu no bɛyam.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14"/>Afei, Absalom ne Israel mpanyimfo nyinaa kae se, “Husai afotu no ye sen Ahitofel de no.” Efisɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyehyɛ sɛ Ahitofel afotu pa a ɔde ama no bɛsɛe, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔhaw ne abɛbrɛsɛ bɛba Absalom so.<verse eid="2SA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Husai Bɔ Dawid Kɔkɔ Sɛ Onguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15"/>Na Husai kɔkaa asɛm a Ahitofel aka ne ɔno ankasa adwenkyerɛ no kyerɛɛ asɔfo Sadok ne Abiatar. <verse eid="2SA 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Ntɛm! Monkɔhwehwɛ Dawid, na monka nkyerɛ no se, ɔnntena Asubɔnten Yordan aworoe so hɔ anadwo yi. Ɛsɛ sɛ otwa kɔ sare no so akyi, anyɛ saa a, ɔne nʼakofo nyinaa bewuwu.”<verse eid="2SA 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17"/>Yonatan ne Ahimaas tenaa En-Rogel, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔrenkɔ kurow no mu na wɔnnsan mpue. Na wɔayɛ nhyehyɛe bi sɛ abaawa bi de nkra a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde kɔma ɔhene Dawid no bɛbrɛ wɔn. <verse eid="2SA 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18"/>Nanso abarimaa bi huu wɔn sɛ wɔrefi En-Rogel akɔ Dawid nkyɛn nti, ɔkɔka kyerɛɛ Absalom. Na woguan kɔɔ Bahurim, maa ɔbarima bi de wɔn kosiee abura bi a ɛwɔ nʼadiwo mu. <verse eid="2SA 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19"/>Ɔbarima no yere de ntama kataa abura no so, de atoko guu so te sɛnea ɔrehata no owia so, na obiara ansusuw sɛ nnipa hyɛ abura no mu.<verse eid="2SA 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20"/>Bere a Absalom mmarima no duu hɔ no, wobisaa ɔbea no se, “Woahu Ahimaas ne Yonatan ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Obuaa wɔn se, “Na wɔwɔ ha de, nanso wɔatwa asuwa no kɔ.” Absalom mmarima no hwehwɛɛ wɔn, nanso wɔanhu wɔn nti, wɔsan kɔɔ Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21"/>Afei mmarima baanu no fii abura no mu, de mmirika kɔɔ ɔhene Dawid nkyɛn kɔbɔɔ no amanneɛ se, “Fi ha twa asu no ntɛm anadwo yi!” Wɔkaa Ahitofel afotu a ɛbɛma wɔakyere no akum no no kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="2SA 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22"/>Enti Dawid ne nnipa no nyinaa tutuu so, kotwaa Yordan. Eduu adekyee no, na obiara atwa Yordan kɔ nʼagya.<verse eid="2SA 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23"/>Ahitofel huu sɛ nʼanim agu ase, efisɛ wɔamfa nʼafotu no, ɔhyehyɛɛ nʼafurum tenaa ne so, kɔɔ ne kurom. Ɔtotoo ne nneɛma yiye, na ɔkɔsɛn ne ho. Enti owu ma wosiee no wɔ nʼagya ɔda mu.<verse eid="2SA 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24"/>Ankyɛ na Dawid duu Mahanaim. Saa bere no na Absalom aboaboa Israel asraafo no nyinaa ano a odi wɔn anim rekotwa Asubɔnten Yordan. <verse eid="2SA 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25"/>Absalom yii Amasa de no tuaa asraafo no ano, sii Yoab a na anka ɔyɛ Dawid sahene no anan mu. Amasa yɛ ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Yitra, a ɔyɛ Israelni a ɔwaree Abigail a ɔyɛ Nahas babea, na ɔyɛ Seruia nuabea, a ɔyɛ Yoab na ba. <verse eid="2SA 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26"/>Israelfo no ne Absalom tenaa Gilead asase so.<verse eid="2SA 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27"/>Na Dawid duu Mahanaim no, Nahas a ofi Raba babarima Sobi Amonni no, kyiaa no fɛw so. Saa ara na Amiel a ofi Lo-debar babarima Makir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saa Makir yi ara na ogyee Mefiboset (Yonatan ba bubuafo) no ne no tenaa Lo-debar no.</char></note> ne Gileadni Barsilai a ofi Rogelim nso gyee no fɛw so. <verse eid="2SA 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28"/>Wɔbrɛɛ no kɛtɛ, nkuku ne nkaka, atoko, asikresiam, nkyewe, asɛ ne asedua, <verse eid="2SA 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29"/>ɛwo ne nufusu ani srade ne anantwi nufusu a akyenkyen mua. Wɔde brɛɛ Dawid ne ne nkurɔfo a wɔka ne ho no. Na wɔkae se, “Mo nyinaa moabrɛbrɛ, na ɔkɔm ne osukɔm de mo efisɛ moanantew kwan tenten wɔ sare so.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Absalom Nkogu Ne Ne Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1"/>Afei, Dawid yiyii asahene ne asafohene dii nʼakofo anim. <verse eid="2SA 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2"/>Yoab na na otua wɔn mu nkyemu abiɛsa mu baako ano. Yoab nuabarima Abisai a na ɔyɛ Seruia babarima na na otua nkyemu abiɛsa mu baako nso ano. Ɛnna nkyemu abiɛsa mu baako a aka no, Gatni Itai na na otua ano. Ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ nʼakofo no se, “Me ne mo na ɛrekɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3"/>Nanso ne mmarima no tiaa mu denneennen se, “Ɛnsɛ se wokɔ bi. Na sɛ ɛba sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ yegyae, na yeguan, na sɛ mpo, yɛn mu fa koraa wuwu a, ɛrennu Absalom asraafo no ho hwee. Wo ara na wɔbɛhwehwɛ. Wo nko ara yɛ yɛn mu mpem du, enti eye sɛ wobɛtena kurom na sɛ mmoa bi ho hia yɛn a, wode bɛba.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4"/>Ɔhene penee so se, “Sɛ modwene sɛ ɛno ne adwene pa de a, mate.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4">Enti okogyinaa kurow no pon ano, bere a asraafo no rekɔ no. <verse eid="2SA 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5"/>Na ɔhene no hyɛɛ Yoab, Abisai ne Itai se, “Me nti mo ne abofra Absalom nni no bɔkɔɔ.” Na asraafo no nyinaa tee saa ɔhyɛ a ɔhene hyɛɛ nʼasafohene no.<verse eid="2SA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6"/>Enti ɔko no fii ase wɔ Efraim kwae mu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7"/>Na Dawid mmarima no yɛɛ Israel asraafo no pasaa. Ɛyɛ afoa ano kum, na da no, mmarima mpem aduonu na wɔhweree wɔn nkwa. <verse eid="2SA 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8"/>Ɔko no didi kɔɔ nkurow so, na esiane kwae no nti, nnipa pii wuwu sen wɔn a wowuwuu wɔ afoa ano no.<verse eid="2SA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9"/>Ɔko no gyina mu no, Absalom puee prɛko pɛ wɔ Dawid mmarima no bi mu. Ɔpɛɛ sɛ oguan wɔ nʼafurumpɔnkɔ so, nanso oguan kɔfaa ɔdɔtɔ bi mu wɔ odum bi ase. Ɔdɔtɔ no kyekyeree ne tinwi, ma ɔkaa mu. Nʼafurumpɔnkɔ no de, na kɔ ara na ɔrekɔ enti, ogyaw no hɔ a, ɔsensɛn ɔdɔtɔ no mu a ɔretow donko wɔ wim.<verse eid="2SA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10"/>Dawid mmarima no baako huu asɛm a asi no, ɔka kyerɛɛ Yoab se, “Mihuu Absalom sɛ ɔsensɛn dua bi so wɔ ɔdɔtɔ mu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11"/>Yoab bisae se, “Asɛm pa ara? Wuhuu no na woankum no? Anka mɛma wo dwetɛ gram ɔha ne dunan (114) ne akokoduru nkyekyeremu sɛ siade.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12"/>Ɔbarima no buae se, “Sɛ anka wobɛma me dwetɛ kilogram dubaako ne fa koraa a, anka merenyɛ saa. Yɛn nyinaa tee sɛ, ɔhene ka kyerɛɛ wo, Abisai ne Itai se, ‘Me nti, obiara nnyɛ aberante Absalom bɔne.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13"/>Na sɛ mibu ɔhene asɛm so kum ne babarima a, anka nea ɛbɛyɛ biara, ɔhene bɛhwehwɛ nea ɔyɛɛ saa. Na anka wʼankasa ne onipa a anka wubeyi me ama.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14"/>Yoab kae se, “Merentwentwɛn me nan ase mma wo wɔ eyi ho.” Enti, ɔtwee mpɛmɛ abiɛsa de wowɔɔ Absalom koma mu bere a na ɔsensɛn odum no so a na onwui no. <verse eid="2SA 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15"/>Yoab akodekurafo no mu mmerante du twaa Absalom ho hyiae, na wokum no.<verse eid="2SA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16"/>Na Yoab hyɛn torobɛnto, maa asraafo no gyaee Israel taa. <verse eid="2SA 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17"/>Wɔfaa Absalom amu no tow kyenee amoa donkudonku bi mu wɔ kwae mu hɔ, na wɔsoaa abotan guu ne so. Na Israelfo no nyinaa guan kɔɔ wɔn afi. <verse eid="2SA 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18"/>Bere a Absalom te ase no, osii nkaedum bi wɔ ɔhene bon mu de kaee ɔno ara ne ho, efisɛ ɔdwenee se, “Minni ɔbabarima biara a ɔbɛyɛ nkae ade biara de akae me din.” Ɔde nkaedum no too ne ho, na wɔfrɛ no Absalom Nkaedum de besi nnɛ.<verse eid="2SA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Su Absalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19"/>Na Sadok babarima Ahimaas kae se, “Momma mintu mmirika nkɔbɔ ɔhene amanneɛ sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi no afi atamfo nsam.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20"/>Na Yoab nso ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Sɛ ɔhene ba awu a, ɛnyɛ asɛm papa mma no. Wubetumi akɔbɔ saa amanneɛ no da foforo bi, na ɛnyɛ nnɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21"/>Na Yoab ka kyerɛɛ Kusni bi se, “Kɔ na kɔka nea woahu no kyerɛ ɔhene.” Ɛhɔ ara na Kusni no bɔɔ ne mu ase wɔ Yoab anim, na otuu mmirika kɔe.<verse eid="2SA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22"/>Bio, Sadok babarima Ahimaas ka kyerɛɛ Yoab se, “Nea ɛbɛba biara mmra, ma me ne Kusni no nkɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Nanso Yoab bisaa no se, “Me ba, adɛn nti na wopɛ sɛ wokɔ? Wunni amanneɛbɔ biara a ɛbɛma wo abasobɔde biara.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23"/>Ɔkae se, “Mepene so, nanso ma menkɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Enti Yoab ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Kɔ!” Na Ahimaas faa tataw no so kɔ kotwaa Kusni no ho.<verse eid="2SA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24"/>Bere a Dawid te kurow no pon ano no, ne wɛmfo no kɔɔ kurow no pon no atifi wɔ ɔfasu no so. Ɔtoo nʼani no, ohuu sɛ obi de mmirika reba. <verse eid="2SA 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25"/>Ɔwɛmfo no teɛɛ mu ka kyerɛɛ Dawid na ɔhene no buae se, “Sɛ ɔno nko ara na ɔnam de a, ebia, na ɔde asɛm pa nam.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Bere a ɔsomafo no rebɛn no, <verse eid="2SA 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26"/>ɔwɛmfo no huu sɛ ɔbarima foforo nso di so reba, na ɔteɛɛ mu se, “Hwɛ onipa foforo bi de mmirika reba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Ɔhene no kae se, “Ebia na ɔno nso de asɛm pa na ɛnam.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27"/>Ɔwɛmfo no kae se, “Ɔbarima a odi kan no sɛ Sadok babarima Ahimaas.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Ɔhene no kae se, “Ɔyɛ onipa pa a, ɔde asɛm pa nam.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28"/>Na Ahimaas teɛɛ mu, frɛɛ ɔhene no se, “Biribiara ye!” Ɔkotow wɔ ɔhene no anim, de nʼanim butuw fam kae se, “Anuonyam nka <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn. Ɔde nnipa a wɔyɛɛ adɔm tiaa me wura ɔhene ahyɛ ne nsa.”<verse eid="2SA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29"/>Ɔhene bisae se, “Na aberante, Absalom ho ye ana?” Ahimaas buae se, “Bere a Yoab yɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔsoma ɔhene somfo ne me wo somfo no, mihuu sɛ nneɛma ayɛ basaa a na minhu mu yiye.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30"/>Ɔhene ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Gyina nkyɛn ha na twɛn.” Enti ogyinaa nkyɛn twɛnee.<verse eid="2SA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31"/>Na Kusni no bedu kae se, “Me wura, Nana, tie asɛm pa a mede nam! Nnɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi wo afi wɔn a wɔsɔre tiaa wo no nyinaa nsam.”<verse eid="2SA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32"/>Na ɔhene bisaa Kusni no se, “Na aberante Absalom ho te dɛn?” Kusni no buae se, “Me wura ɔhene, atamfo nyinaa ne wɔn a wɔsɔre tia wo, pɛ sɛ wɔyɛ wo bɔne no, nhu amane sɛ saa aberante no.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33"/>Ɔhene ho wosowee. Ɔfaa ɔkwan ano pon no mu kɔɔ ne dan mu kosui, twaa adwo. Ɔrekɔ no, ɔkae se, “Ao, me ba Absalom! Me ba, me ba Absalom! Anka minwu nnya wo! Ao, Absalom, me ba, me ba!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoab Ka Ɔhene Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1"/>Ankyɛ na nkra duu Yoab nkyɛn se ɔhene no resu, redi awerɛhow wɔ Absalom ho. <verse eid="2SA 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2"/>Bere a asraafo no tee ɔhene no awerɛhow a ɔredi wɔ ne ba no ho no, nkonimdi mu anigye a na wɔwɔ mu saa da no dan awerɛhow. <verse eid="2SA 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3"/>Wowiaa wɔn ho kɔɔ kurow no mu sɛnea wɔn a wɔadi nkogu de aniwu guan fi ɔko mu. <verse eid="2SA 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4"/>Ɔhene de ne nsa kataa nʼanim, kɔɔ so twaa adwo se, “Ao, me ba Absalom! Ao, Absalom, me ba, me ba!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5"/>Na Yoab kɔɔ ɔhene no dan mu kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Nnɛ yɛagye wo, ne wo mmabarima, ne wo mmabea, ne wo yerenom, ne wo mpenanom nkwa. Nanso woreyɛ eyi de gu yɛn anim ase te sɛ nea yɛayɛ bɔne bi. <verse eid="2SA 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6"/>Wodɔ wʼatamfo, na wotan wʼadɔfo. Woada no adi nnɛ sɛ, yɛnsɛ hwee mma wo. Sɛ Absalom te ase, na yɛn nyinaa awuwu a, anka wopɛ no saa. <verse eid="2SA 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7"/>Afei, fi kɔ mprempren, na kɔma asraafo no mo, na mebɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din, ka ntam se, sɛ woanyɛ saa a, wɔn mu baako koraa nka ha anadwo yi. Na ɛbɛma woagyigya asen kan no.”<verse eid="2SA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8"/>Na ɔhene no fii adi kɔtenaa kurow no abɔntenpon no ano. Na asɛm no trɛw kurow no mu nyinaa sɛ ɔwɔ hɔ no, obiara kɔɔ ne nkyɛn. Saa bere no na Israelfo a wɔtaa Absalom akyi no nyinaa aguan kɔ wɔn afi mu. <verse eid="2SA 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9"/>Na Israel mmusuakuw no nyinaa mu, na wɔredi abooboo, gye akyinnye. Na nnipa no reka se, “Ɔhene no gyee yɛn fii atamfo a wɔyɛ Filistifo nsam, nanso Absalom taa no, pam no fii ɔman no mu. <verse eid="2SA 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10"/>Na mprempren Absalom a wɔsraa no sɛ ommedi yɛn so hene no nso awu. Momma yɛnkɔka nkyerɛ Dawid na ɔnsan mmra mmedi yɛn so.”<verse eid="2SA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11"/>Na ɔhene Dawid somaa asɔfo Sadok ne Abiatar, ma wokobisaa Yuda mpanyimfo se, “Adɛn nti na mo de, mompɛ sɛ mode ɔhene ahenni bɛsan ama no? Na mate sɛ Israel nyinaa ayɛ krado, na mo nko ara na motwentwɛn mo anan ase. <verse eid="2SA 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12"/>Moyɛ mʼabusuafo, mʼabusuakuw, mʼankasa me honam ne me mogya. Na ɛno nti, adɛn nti na mutwa to wɔ wɔn a wɔpene sɛ mɛsan aba no mu?” <verse eid="2SA 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13"/>Dawid ma wɔkɔka kyerɛɛ Amasa se, “Sɛ woyɛ me wɔfaase yi, sɛ manyɛ wo ɔsahene ansi Yoab anan mu a, Onyankopɔn ne me nni no nwenweenwen.”<verse eid="2SA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14"/>Afei, Amasa bɔɔ Yuda ntuanofo no nyinaa adafa, ma wotiee no sɛ nnipa koro. Wɔde saa asɛm yi kɔtoo ɔhene anim se, “Wo ne wɔn a wɔne wo wɔ hɔ no nyinaa mmra yɛn nkyɛn.”<verse eid="2SA 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid San Kɔ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15"/>Na ɔhene no de nʼani kyerɛɛ Yerusalem. Oduu Asubɔnten Yordan ho no, Yudafo behyiaa no sɛ wɔde no retwa asu no. <verse eid="2SA 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16"/>Gera a ɔyɛ Benyaminni a ofi Bahurim babarima Simei ne Yuda mmarima yɛɛ ntɛm kohyiaa ɔhene Dawid. <verse eid="2SA 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17"/>Ɔrekɔ no, na Benyaminfo apem ka ne ho, a na Siba a na ɔyɛ Saulo fi mu soodoni ne ne mmabarima dunum ne nʼasomfo aduonu ka ho. Wɔyɛɛ ntɛm dii ɔhene no kan koduu Yordan hɔ. <verse eid="2SA 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18"/>Wotwa kɔɔ baabi a ɛhɔ nnɔ kɔfaa ɔhene fifo no de wɔn twaa asu no, na wɔyɛɛ nea wɔpɛ biara maa wɔn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Bere a Gera ba Simei twaa asu no, kɔkotow ɔhene no, <verse eid="2SA 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19"/>srɛɛ no se, “Me wura ɔhene, fa me bɔne kyɛ me. Nkae bɔne a wʼakoa yɛe bere a wufii Yerusalem no Ɔhene yi fi wʼadwene mu. <verse eid="2SA 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20"/>Mahu bɔne a mayɛ, enti na madi kan wɔ Yosef abusua nyinaa mu rebekyia wo yi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21"/>Na Seruia babarima Abisai kae se, “Simei sɛ owu, efisɛ ɔdomee nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asra no no.”<verse eid="2SA 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22"/>Na Dawid bisae se, “Mo Seruia mma, dɛn na me ne mo wɔ yɛ? Nnɛ nyɛ da a wokum obi. Ɛyɛ anigye da! Masan mabedi hene wɔ Israel so bio!” <verse eid="2SA 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23"/>Enti ɔhene no kaa ntam kyerɛɛ Simei se, “Wɔrenkum wo.”<verse eid="2SA 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Yɛ Mefiboset Adɔe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24"/>Mefiboset a ɔyɛ Saulo nena nso kohyiaa ɔhene no bi. Efi bere a ɔhene kɔe no, na onsiesiee ne nan ase, nyii ne hweneanonwi, nhoroo ne ntade da, kosii sɛ ɔhene san baa asomdwoe mu no. <verse eid="2SA 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25"/>Ɔhene no bisaa no se, “Mefiboset, adɛn nti na wo ne me ankɔ?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26"/>Obuae se, “Nana, me somfo Siba daadaa me. Meyɛ obubuafo nti, mekae se, ‘hyehyɛ mʼafurum ma me, na mentena ne so, sɛnea metumi ne ɔhene akɔ.’ <verse eid="2SA 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27"/>Siba abɛsɛe me akyerɛ me wura ɔhene sɛ mampɛ sɛ meba. Nanso minim sɛ wote sɛ Onyankopɔn bɔfo; ne saa nti, yɛ nea wugye di sɛ eye. <verse eid="2SA 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28"/>Biribiara mfata me ne me nenabarima asefo sɛ owu a ebefi me wura, ɔhene, nanso, woahyɛ me anuonyam wɔ wɔn a wodidi wo pon so no mu. Enti tumi bɛn na mewɔ sɛ mibisa ɔhene nea mehwehwɛ?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29"/>Ɔhene ka kyerɛɛ no se, “Adɛn nti na wʼasɛm aware? Mehyɛ mo sɛ, wo ne Siba nkyɛ nsase no mu.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30"/>Mefiboset ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no se, “Sɛ me wura ɔhene asan aba fie dwoodwoo yi, ma Siba mfa biribiara.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Yɛ Barsilai Adɔe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31"/>Gileadni Barsilai nso fi Rogelim baa sɛ ɔrebɛboa ama ɔhene atwa Yordan. <verse eid="2SA 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32"/>Na Barsilai abɔ akwakoraa a wadi mfe aduɔwɔtwe, na ɔyɛ ɔdefo kɛse. Ɔno na ɔmaa ɔhene biribi dii bere a na ɔte Mahanaim no. <verse eid="2SA 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33"/>Ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ Barsilai se, “Wo ne me ntwa, na wo ne me nkɔtena Yerusalem, na mɛhwɛ wo.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34"/>Nanso, Barsilai buaa ɔhene se, “Aka me nna ahe a ɛsɛ sɛ me ne wo kɔtena Yerusalem, Nana? <verse eid="2SA 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35"/>Madi mfirihyia aduɔwɔtwe, na biribiara nyɛ me akɔnnɔ. Aduan ne nsa nyɛ me dɛ. Nnwontofo nne nso, merente na adesoa nko ara na mɛyɛ ama Nana. <verse eid="2SA 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36"/>Anuonyam a mepɛ ara ne sɛ me ne Nana betwa asu no. <verse eid="2SA 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37"/>Ma wo somfo nsan nʼakyi, sɛnea mewu wɔ me ara me kurom faako a wosiee mʼawofo. Na me babarima Kimham ni. Ma ɔne me wura ɔhene nkɔ na ade pa biara a wopɛ no, yɛ ma no.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38"/>Ɔhene no gye too mu kae se, “Eye, Kimham ne me bɛkɔ, na nea anka mɛyɛ ama wo no, mɛyɛ ama no.”<verse eid="2SA 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39"/>Enti nnipa no nyinaa ne ɔhene twaa Yordan, ɔhene no yɛɛ Barsilai atuu, hyiraa no. Na Barsilai san kɔɔ ne kurom. <verse eid="2SA 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40"/>Ɔhene faa Kimham kaa ne ho kɔɔ Gilgal. Yuda asraafo nyinaa ne Israel asraafo no mu fa de ɔhene twaa asu no.<verse eid="2SA 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔhene Ho Akyinnyegye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41"/>Ankyɛ, Israel mmarima nyinaa baa ɔhene hɔ bebisaa no se, “Adɛn nti na yɛn nuanom Yuda mmarima wiaa ɔhene kɔe, na wɔde Ɔhene ne ne fifo ne Dawid mmarima nyinaa a wɔka ne ho no akotwa Yordan aba?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42"/>Yuda mmarima nyinaa buaa Israel mmarima no se, “Yɛyɛɛ saa, efisɛ, ɔhene no yɛ yɛn busuani pɛɛ. Adɛn nti na mo bo afuw wɔ saa asɛm yi ho? Yɛannye no hwee na ɔno nso amma yɛn aduan anaa akyɛde biara nso.”<verse eid="2SA 19:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43"/>Na Israel mmarima buaa Yuda mmarima no se, “Yɛwɔ mmusuakuw du wɔ Israel na ɛno nti yɛwɔ ɔhene no mu kyɛfa du. Na adɛn nti na mubu yɛn abomfiaa? Ɛnyɛ yɛn na yedii kan kae se, wɔmfa yɛn hene nsan mmra?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Na Yuda mmarima no ano yɛɛ den sen Israel mmarima no.<verse eid="2SA 19:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Seba Atuatew</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1"/>Ɔtɔkwapɛfo bi a na wɔfrɛ no Seba na ɔyɛ Bikri a ofi Benyamin babarima, hyɛn torobɛnto teɛɛ mu se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">“Yɛne Dawid nni hwee yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">Yenni agyapade biara wɔ Yisai babarima no nkyɛn. Israel mmarima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">mommra na yɛn nyinaa nkɔ yɛn kurom!”<verse eid="2SA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2"/>Enti Israel mmarima gyaw Dawid hɔ, kodii Seba akyi. Nanso Yuda mmarima no de, wɔtenaa wɔn hene nkyɛn, na wɔwowaw no fi Asubɔnten Yordan ho, kosii Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3"/>Bere a oduu nʼahemfi hɔ wɔ Yerusalem no, ɔhyɛɛ sɛ ne mpenanom du a ogyaw wɔn hɔ no, wɔmfa wɔn nkɔhyɛ kokoa mu baabi. Na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔma wɔn wɔn ahiade nyinaa, nanso ɔne wɔn renna bio. Enti wɔn mu biara tenaa ase sɛ okunafo, kosii ne wuda.<verse eid="2SA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4"/>Ɔhene no hyɛɛ Amasa sɛ ɔmfa nnansa mmoaboa Yuda asraafo ano, na ɔmmɛka biribi nkyerɛ no saa bere no mu. <verse eid="2SA 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5"/>Enti Amasa kɔbɔɔ asraafo no amanneɛ, nanso nʼahoboa no boroo nnansa no.<verse eid="2SA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6"/>Na Dawid ka kyerɛɛ Abisai se, “Saa ɔtɔkwapɛfo Seba no rebɛhaw yɛn asen sɛ nea Absalom haw yɛn no. Fa mʼakofo no, na taa no ansa na waguan akɔbɔ ne ho aguaa wɔ hintabea nkurow no mu baabi a yɛn nsa renka no.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7"/>Enti Abisai ne Yoab yiyii awɛmfo a wodi mu fii Yoab asraafo ne ɔhene no ankasa de mu de tiw Seba.<verse eid="2SA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8"/>Na woduu Gibeon ɔbo kɛse no ho no, Amasa hyiaa wɔn. Na Yoab hyɛ nʼakotade a ɔde afoa abɔ nʼataaso. Otuu nten kɔɔ nʼanim sɛ ɔrekokyia Amasa no, afoa no fii boha no mu tɔɔ fam. <verse eid="2SA 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9"/>Yoab bisaa no se, “Me nua, wo ho te dɛn?” Ɛhɔ ara na Yoab de ne nsa nifa soo nʼabogyesɛ mu, sɛ nea ɔrefew nʼano. <verse eid="2SA 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10"/>Amasa anhu sɛ afoa no hyɛ ne nsa benkum mu. Na Yoab de afoa no wɔɔ ne yam, maa ne nsono tu guu fam. Ɛho anhia sɛ Yoab betia ne so koraa, na Amasa wui. Yoab ne ne nuabarima Abisai gyaw no hɔ, toaa so tiw Bikri babarima Seba.<verse eid="2SA 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11"/>Yoab asraafo no mu aberante a ɔyɛ panyin wɔ nsraadɔm no so no mu baako teɛɛ mu kyerɛɛ Amasa asraafo no se, “Obiara a ɔtaa Yoab akyi ne obiara a ɔwɔ Dawid afa no, ommedi Yoab akyi.” <verse eid="2SA 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12"/>Amasa daa ne mogyabura mu wɔ ɔkwan no mfimfini. Na ɔbarima no huu sɛ asraafo no adu hɔ a wɔagyina rehwɛ Amasa no, ɔtwee no fii ɔkwan no mu, de no too wuram, de atade kataa ne so. <verse eid="2SA 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13"/>Woyii Amasa fii ɔkwan no mu akyi no, mmarima no nyinaa dii Yoab akyi sɛ wɔrekɔkyere Bikri babarima Seba.<verse eid="2SA 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14"/>Saa bere no, Seba kyinii Israel nyinaa boaboaa ne fifo Bikrifo ano wɔ Abel-Bet-Maaka. <verse eid="2SA 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15"/>Yoab asraafo no duu hɔ no, wɔtow hyɛɛ Abel-Bet-Maaka so. Wosisii mpie wɔ kurow no akyi, de bɔɔ wɔn ho ban fii atamfo ho na wɔpempem afasu no, pɛɛ sɛ wodwiriw gu. <verse eid="2SA 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16"/>Na ɔbea nyansafo bi teɛɛ mu fi kurow no mu se, “Muntie! Muntie! Monka nkyerɛ Yoab se ɔmmra ha, na menka asɛm bi nkyerɛ no.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17"/>Yoab kɔɔ ne nkyɛn, na obisaa no se, “Wo na wɔfrɛ wo Yoab no?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Obuae se, “Yiw.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Ɔkae se, “Tie asɛm a wʼafenaa pɛ sɛ ɔka no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Obuae se, “Meretie.”<verse eid="2SA 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18"/>Ɔkae se, “Tete no, na yɛka se, ‘Yɛrekɔpɛ afotu wɔ Abel.’ <verse eid="2SA 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19"/>Yɛpɛ asomdwoe ne nokware wɔ Israel. Wopɛ sɛ wosɛe kurow a adi nokware wɔ Israel. Adɛn nti na wopɛ sɛ wosɛe ade a ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dea?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20"/>Yoab buae se, “Ɛnyɛ sɛ mepɛ sɛ mesɛe wo kuropɔn. <verse eid="2SA 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21"/>Nea merehwehwɛ no ara ne ɔbarima bi a ne din de Seba a ɔyɛ Bikri babarima a ofi Efraim bepɔw so, na wama ne ho so atia ɔhene, ɔhene Dawid. Fa saa ɔbarima no bra, na mefi kurow no mu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Ɔbea no ka kyerɛɛ Yoab se, “Wɔbɛtow ne ti afi ɔfasu no so ama wo.”<verse eid="2SA 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22"/>Afei, ɔbea no kɔkaa nʼafotu pa no kyerɛɛ nnipa no nyinaa. Na wotwaa Bikri babarima Seba ti, tow maa Yoab. Enti ɔhyɛn torobɛnto maa ne mmarima no bɔ hwetee, maa obiara kɔɔ ne fi. Na Yoab san kɔɔ ɔhene nkyɛn wɔ Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23"/>Yoab bɛyɛɛ Dawid asraafo no so sahene bio.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:23">Na Yehoiada babarima Benaia nso yɛ ɔhene bammɔfo so panyin.<verse eid="2SA 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24"/>Adoram na na ɔhwɛ adwumayɛfo so,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:24">na Yehosafat a ɔyɛ Ahilud babarima no kyerɛw ahemfo ho abakɔsɛm.<verse eid="2SA 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25"/>Na Sewa yɛ asennii kyerɛwfo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:25">Na Sadok ne Abiatar nso yɛ asɔfo.<verse eid="2SA 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26"/>Ɛnna Yairini Ira nso yɛ Dawid sɔfo.<verse eid="2SA 20:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Tɔ Were Ma Gibeonfo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1"/>Bere a Dawid di hene no, ɔkɔm baa asase no so mfe abiɛsa, enti Dawid bisaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔkɔm no ho asɛm. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kae se, “Esiane fɔ a Saulo ne ne fifo di wɔ kunkum a wokunkum Gibeonfo no ho nti na ɔkɔm saa aba no.”<verse eid="2SA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2"/>Enti ɔhene Dawid frɛɛ Gibeonfo no nyinaa. Na wɔnka Israelfo no ho, na mmom, wɔyɛ Amorifo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Din Amorini yɛ din a wɔde frɛ Kanaanfo nyinaa ansa na wɔredi wɔn so (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:16">1 Mose 15.16</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:18">Yos 24.18</ref></char>). Nokware, Gibeonfo yɛ Hiwifo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 9:7">Yos 9.7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 11:19">11.19</ref></char>).</char></note> nkaefo bi. Israel kaa ntam se, wɔrenkum wɔn, nanso esiane Saulo ahopere nti, ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔtɔre wɔn ase. <verse eid="2SA 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3"/>Dawid bisaa Gibeonfo no se, “Dɛn na metumi ayɛ de apata mo? Monka, sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> behyira ne nkurɔfo bio.”<verse eid="2SA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4"/>Gibeonfo no buae se, “Anokwa, sika rentumi, na yɛmpɛ nso sɛ wobekunkum Israelfo aweretɔ wɔ so.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Enti Dawid kɔɔ so bisaa wɔn se, “Enti dɛn na menyɛ? Monka nkyerɛ me, na mɛyɛ ama mo.”<verse eid="2SA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5"/>Na wobuae se, “Ɛyɛ Saulo na ɔdwenee ho sɛ ɔbɛsɛe yɛn, sɛnea yɛrennya afa biara wɔ Israel. <verse eid="2SA 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6"/>Enti wonyi Saulo mmabarima anaa ne nananom mmarima baason mma yɛn, na yebekum wɔn wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim wɔ Gibea bepɔw no so.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Ɔhene no kaa se, “Eye. Mɛyɛ.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7"/>Dawid gyaee Yonatan babarima Mefiboset a na ɔyɛ Saulo nena no, esiane ntam a na Dawid ne Yonatan aka wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim no nti. <verse eid="2SA 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8"/>Nanso ɔde Saulo mmabarima baanu a na wɔn din de Armoni ne Mefiboset a na wɔn mama Rispa no yɛ Aia babea no maa wɔn. Ɔsan de Saulo babea Mikal a na ɔyɛ Adriel a na ɔyɛ Barsilai a ofi Mehola no yere mmabarima baanum no mae. <verse eid="2SA 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9"/>Na Gibeon mmarima no kunkum wɔn wɔ bepɔw no so wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. Enti nnipa baason no nyinaa, wokunkum wɔn wɔ bere a wɔrefi atokotwa afahyɛ no ase no.<verse eid="2SA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10"/>Rispa a ɔyɛ mmarima no mu baanu mama no de atweaatam sɛw ɔbotan bi so, tenaa hɔ otwabere no nyinaa mu. Wamma nnomaa ammɛsosɔw wɔn amu no awia, na anadwo nso, osiw nkekaboa ho kwan. <verse eid="2SA 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11"/>Bere a Dawid tee nea Rispa a na ɔyɛ Saulo mpena no ayɛ no, <verse eid="2SA 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12"/>ɔkɔɔ nkurɔfo a wofi Yabes Gilead nkyɛn, kobisaa wɔn Saulo ne ne babarima Yonatan nnompe ase. (Bere a Saulo ne Yonatan totɔɔ ɔko a wɔne Filistifo koe no ano no, Yabes Gileadfo na wɔkɔtasee wɔn amu wɔ Filistifo kurow Bet-San abɔnten so.) <verse eid="2SA 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13"/>Enti Dawid de Saulo ne Yonatan nnompe bae. Saa ara na ɔde mmarima a Gibeonfo kunkum wɔn no nso nnompe bae.<verse eid="2SA 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14"/>Osiee wɔn nyinaa wɔ Saulo agya Kis ɔboda a ɛwɔ kurow Sela a ɛwɔ Benyamin asase so no mu. Ɛno akyi, Onyankopɔn twaa ɔkɔm no so wɔ Israel asase so.<verse eid="2SA 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ne Filistifo Akokoakoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15"/>Bio, Filistifo ne Israel koe. Na bere a ɔko no duu ne mpɔmpɔnso no, Dawid brɛe. <verse eid="2SA 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16"/>Na Yisbi-Benob yɛ abran no asefo mu baako. Na ne peaw mu duru kari boro kilogram abiɛsa ne fa, a wɔde afoa foforo ahyehyɛ ne ho. Na waka Dawid ahyɛ a anka ɔrebekum no. <verse eid="2SA 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17"/>Nanso Seruia babarima Abisai begyee Dawid, na okum Filistini no. Ɛno akyi, Dawid mmarima no kaa ntam se, “Wo ne yɛn renkɔ ɔko bio na amma Israel kanea annum no.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18"/>Eyi akyi, ɔko foforo ba de tiaa Filistifo no wɔ Gob. Wogu so reko no, Sibekai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Sibekai da Dawid asraafokuw a ɛto so awotwe no ano (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 27:11">1 Be 27.11</ref></char>).</char></note> a ofi Husan, kum Saf a na ɔno nso yɛ abran no asefo no bi.<verse eid="2SA 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19"/>Ɔko foforo bi a wɔkoo wɔ Gob no nso, Yair babarima Elhanan a ofi Betlehem kum Gatni Goliat nuabarima bi. Na ne peaw mu duru te sɛ ntamanwemfo abaa. <verse eid="2SA 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20"/>Ɔko bi a esii bio wɔ Gat nso, ɔbarima bran bi a na ɔyɛ nsansia ne nansia a ɔyɛ abran no aseni no <verse eid="2SA 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21"/>pɛɛ sɛ obu fa Israel so, gu nʼanim ase. Ɔno nso, Dawid nuabarima Simei babarima Yonatan na okum no.<verse eid="2SA 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22"/>Saa Filistifo abran baanan yi yɛ Gat abran no asefo. Na Dawid ne nʼakofo na wokunkum wɔn nyinaa.<verse eid="2SA 21:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Ayeyi Dwom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1"/>Bere a Awurade gyee Dawid fii nʼatamfo nyinaa ne Saulo nsam akyi no, ɔtoo saa dwom yi de yii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2"/>Nsɛm a ɛwɔ dwom no mu ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ me botan, mʼaban ne mʼagyenkwa;<verse eid="2SA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3"/>me Nyankopɔn yɛ me botan; ne mu na minya guankɔbea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Ɔyɛ me kyɛm, me nkwagye mu ahoɔden,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">mʼabandennen, mʼagyenkwa, nea ogye me fi basabasayɛ mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4"/>“Misu frɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>; ɔno na ayeyi sɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">efisɛ ogye me fi mʼatamfo nsam.<verse eid="2SA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5"/>Owu asorɔkye twaa me ho hyiae;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">ɔsɛe yiri faa me so.<verse eid="2SA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6"/>Ɔda mu hama kyekyeree me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">mihyiaa owu mfiri.<verse eid="2SA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7"/>“Na mʼamanehunu mu no, misu frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">Yiw, mefrɛɛ me Nyankopɔn pɛɛ mmoa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Ɔtee me nne fii ne kronkronbea.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">Me sufrɛ duu nʼasom.<verse eid="2SA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8"/>Na asase wosowee na ehinhimii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">ɔsoro fapem wosowee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">wɔwosowee, nʼabufuw nti.<verse eid="2SA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9"/>Wusiw fii ne hwene mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">ogyaframa fii nʼanom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">na nnyansramma dɛw fii mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10"/>Ofii ɔsoro baa fam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">na omununkum kabii duruu nʼanan ase.<verse eid="2SA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11"/>Ɔte kerubim so tui;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">gyaagyaa ne ho wɔ mframa ntaban so.<verse eid="2SA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12"/>Ɔde sum kataa ne ho hyiae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">ɔde osu mununkum dii nʼanim kan.<verse eid="2SA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13"/>Hann kɛse hyerɛn wɔ nʼanim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">na anyinam pa fii mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bobɔɔ mu fi ɔsoro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">Ɔsorosoroni no teɛɛ mu dennen.<verse eid="2SA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15"/>Ɔtow nʼagyan maa nʼatamfo hwetee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">anyinam twa ma wɔyɛɛ basaa.<verse eid="2SA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kasae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">na wiase nnyinaso no nyinaa daa hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">Wotumi huu ɛpo ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">na asase fapem ho daa hɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17"/>“Ofi ɔsoro baa fam besoo me mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">ɔtwee me fii asu a emu dɔ mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18"/>Ogyee me fii mʼatamfo a wɔyɛ den nsam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">atamfo a wokyi me na wɔn ho yɛ den pa ara sen me.<verse eid="2SA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19"/>Wɔbaa me so wɔ mʼamanehunu da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> pagyaw me.<verse eid="2SA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20"/>Ɔde me baa baabi a bammɔ wɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">ogyee me, efisɛ nʼani kum me ho.<verse eid="2SA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> atua me papayɛ so ka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">me bem a midi no, wahyɛ me anan mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22"/>Efisɛ manantew <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akwan so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">mentwee me ho mfii me Nyankopɔn ho nkɔyɛɛ bɔne.<verse eid="2SA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23"/>Ne mmara nyinaa gu mʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">mentwee me ho mfii ne nhyehyɛe ho.<verse eid="2SA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24"/>Me ho nni asɛm wɔ Onyankopɔn anim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">matwe me ho afi bɔne ho.<verse eid="2SA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tuaa me papayɛ so ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:25">efisɛ minni fɔ wɔ nʼanim.<verse eid="2SA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26"/>“Woda wo ho adi sɛ ɔnokwafo kyerɛ wɔn a wodi nokware,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">wɔn a wodi mu nso wo kyerɛ wɔn sɛ wodi mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27"/>Wuyi wo kronkronyɛ kyerɛ ɔkronkronni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">nanso amumɔyɛfo de wukyi wɔn.<verse eid="2SA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28"/>Wugye ahobrɛasefo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">nanso wʼani kɔ ahantanfo so sɛ wobɛbrɛ wɔn ase.<verse eid="2SA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29"/>Wo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woyɛ me kanea.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">Yiw, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> woma me sum dan hann.<verse eid="2SA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30"/>Wʼahoɔden mu, metumi aka asraafokuw agu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">me Nyankopɔn nti, mitumi foro ɔfasu.<verse eid="2SA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31"/>“Onyankopɔn de, nʼakwan yɛ pɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔhyɛ nyinaa ba mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">Ɔyɛ nkatabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">ma wɔn a wɔhwehwɛ bammɔ wɔ ne mu.<verse eid="2SA 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32"/>Hena ne Onyankopɔn, gye sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">Hena ne ɔbotantim no, gye sɛ yɛn Nyankopɔn?<verse eid="2SA 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33"/>Onyankopɔn ne mʼaban a ɛyɛ den;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">wagye me, na wama me kwan so ayɛ pɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34"/>Ɔma mʼanammɔn ho yɛ hare sɛ ɔforote de;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">Ɔma me gyina sorɔnsorɔmmea.<verse eid="2SA 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35"/>Osiesie me ma ɔko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">na me basa tumi kuntun kɔbere mfrafrae tadua.<verse eid="2SA 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36"/>Woama me wo nkwagye kyɛm.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">Wo mmoa ama mayɛ ɔkɛse.<verse eid="2SA 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37"/>Woabɔ kwan tɛtrɛɛ ama mʼanan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">sɛnea me nkotodwe rengurow.<verse eid="2SA 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38"/>“Metaa mʼatamfo sɛee wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">mannyina kosii sɛ wodii nkogu.<verse eid="2SA 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39"/>Meyam wɔn, mebɔɔ wɔn hwee fam, na wɔantumi ansɔre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">wɔhwehwee ase wɔ mʼanan ase.<verse eid="2SA 22:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40"/>Wohyɛɛ me ahoɔden maa ɔko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">woaka mʼatamfo ahyɛ mʼanan ase.<verse eid="2SA 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41"/>Womaa wɔdan wɔn ani guanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">na mesɛe wɔn a wɔtan me nyinaa.<verse eid="2SA 22:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42"/>Wosu pɛɛ mmoa, nanso obiara ammegye wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">Wosu frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, nanso wannye wɔn so.<verse eid="2SA 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43"/>Meyam wɔn ma wɔyɛɛ sɛ asase so mfutuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">mepraa wɔn guu suka mu sɛ wura.<verse eid="2SA 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44"/>“Womaa me nkonimdi wɔ wɔn a wɔbɔ me kwaadu so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">Woahwɛ sɛ mɛyɛ amanaman sodifo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">na nnipa a minnim wɔn som me.<verse eid="2SA 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45"/>Ananafo brɛ wɔn ho ase ma me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">wɔte me nka pɛ ara a, wɔde wɔn ho ma me.<verse eid="2SA 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46"/>Wɔn nyinaa bɔ huboa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">na wɔde ahopopo fi wɔn nsraban mu ba.<verse eid="2SA 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase! Ayeyi nka me botan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">ma wɔmma Onyankopɔn, me nkwagye botan so.<verse eid="2SA 22:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48"/>Ɔno ne Onyankopɔn a ɔtɔ wɔn a wɔhaw me so were;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">ɔka amanaman no hyɛ mʼase<verse eid="2SA 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49"/>na ogye me fi mʼatamfo nsam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Wode me si baabi a mʼatamfo nnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">wugye me fi atutuwpɛfo a wotia me nsam.<verse eid="2SA 22:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> eyi nti, mɛkamfo wo wɔ amanaman mu, Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">Mɛto ayeyi dwom ama wo din.<verse eid="2SA 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51"/>“Wode nkonimdi akɛse ama wo hene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">woda ɔdɔ a ɛnsa da adi kyerɛ nea woasra no ngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">wode kyerɛ Dawid, ne nʼasefo afebɔɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Nsɛm A Etwa To</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1"/>Eyi ne Dawid nsɛm a etwaa to:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">“Dawid, Yisai ba barima a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">Onyankopɔn maa no nkɔso a ɛyɛ nwonwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">na Yakob Nyankopɔn sraa no ngo no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">Israel nnwomhyehyɛfo mu otiban:<verse eid="2SA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> honhom kasa fa me mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">ne nsɛm wɔ me tɛkrɛma so.<verse eid="2SA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3"/>Israel Nyankopɔn kasae.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Israel botan ka kyerɛɛ me se:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Onipa a odi hene trenee mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">na ɔde Onyamesuro di hene no,<verse eid="2SA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4"/>ɔte sɛ anɔpa hann,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">ɔte sɛ anɔpa a omununkum nni hɔ apueiwia hann;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">ɔte sɛ osutɔ akyi hyerɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">na ɛma sare foforo pue fi asase mu.’<verse eid="2SA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5"/>“Ɛyɛ me fi na Onyankopɔn ayi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">Yiw, ɔne me ayɛ apam a ɛwɔ hɔ daa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Ne nhyehyɛe yɛ afebɔɔ, bi nni hɔ bio, na wɔasɔw ano.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">Ɔbɛhwɛ me yiyedi ne me nkɔso daa.<verse eid="2SA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6"/>Na wɔn a wonnim Onyame no te sɛ nsɔe a wɔbɛtow agu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">efisɛ wɔwowɔ nsa a eso mu no.<verse eid="2SA 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ obi kɔ amia mu ansa na watwa wɔn agu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">wɔde ogya bɛhyew wɔn dwerɛbee.”<verse eid="2SA 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Dɔmmarima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8"/>Din a edidi so yi yɛ Dawid dɔmmarima:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:8">Nea odi kan ne Yoseb-Basebet a ofi Tahkemon, na ɔyɛ ɔsahene wɔ akofo akɛse Baasa bi so wɔ Dawid mmarima no mu. Ɔno na ɔde ne peaw kum atamfo akofo ahanwɔtwe wɔ ɔsa baako pɛ mu no.<verse eid="2SA 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9"/>Nea ɔto so abien wɔ baasa no mu no ne Dodo babarima Eleasar a ɔyɛ Ahohi aseni. Bere bi Eleasar ne Dawid ka bɔɔ mu, tew gyinae, de tiaa Filistifo bere a Israel asraafo no nyinaa aguan no. <verse eid="2SA 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10"/>Okunkum Filistifo no ara kosii sɛ afei, na ontumi mpagyaw ne peaw. Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> maa no dii nkonim saa da no. Asraafo a wɔaka no ansan amma kosii bere a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkɔtase wɔn asade no.<verse eid="2SA 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11"/>Nea odi hɔ yɛ Sama a ɔyɛ Agee a ofi Harar babarima. Da koro bi, Filistifo no boaa wɔn ho ano wɔ Lehi, na wɔtow hyɛɛ Israelfo no so wɔ aseduafuw bi mu. Israel asraafo no guanee, <verse eid="2SA 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12"/>nanso Sama gyinaa ne nan so pintinn wɔ afuw no mfimfini, kaa Filistifo no gui. Enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma odii nkonim.<verse eid="2SA 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13"/>Twabere bi a na Dawid wɔ Adulam ɔbodan mu no, Filisti asraafo bɛkyeree nsraban wɔ Refaim bon mu. Dawid akofo nimdefo aduasa no mu baasa sian kohyiaa no wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="2SA 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14"/>Saa bere no na Dawid te nsraban mu hɔ a na Filistifo asraafo no fa bi nso akɔtena Betlehem. <verse eid="2SA 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15"/>Dawid daa nʼakɔnnɔ adi se, “Ao, sɛ minya nsu pa a ɛwɔ Betlehem abura a ɛwɔ kurow no pon no ano hɔ no bi a, anka mɛnom.” <verse eid="2SA 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16"/>Enti baasa no bu faa Filistifo no mu kɔsaw nsu no bi fii abura no mu, de brɛɛ Dawid. Nanso wannom. Mmom, ohwie guu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim. <verse eid="2SA 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17"/>Ɔteɛɛ mu se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma ɛmpare me sɛ mɛnom eyi! Saa nsu yi som bo te sɛ saa mmarima yi a wɔde wɔn nkwa too hɔ, kɔsaw nsu yi brɛɛ me yi mogya.” Enti Dawid annom. Mmarimasɛm a Baasa no dii no nhwɛso bi ni.<verse eid="2SA 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Akofo Akɛse Aduasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18"/>Na Yoab nua Seruia babarima Abisai nso dii Aduasa no anim. Da bi, ɔde ne peaw kum atamfo akofo ahaasa wɔ ɔsa baako pɛ mu. Saa akokodurusɛm yi nti ne din hyetaa sɛ Baasa no. <verse eid="2SA 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19"/>Abisai na ogyee din pa ara wɔ Aduasa no mu. Ɛwɔ mu, wannye din sɛ Baasa no ho de, nanso na ɔno ne Aduasa no safohene.<verse eid="2SA 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20"/>Na Yehoiada babarima Benaia nso yɛ ɔkofo kokodurufo a ofi Kabseel. Odii mmarimasɛm bebree a bi ne sɛ, okum Moab akofo akɛse baanu. Bere bi nso, ɔtaa gyata, ma wɔkɔtɔɔ amoa mu. Na sukyerɛmma atɔ, ama fam ayɛ toro de, nanso ɔkyeree gyata no, kum no. <verse eid="2SA 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21"/>Bere bi nso, ɔde abaaporiwa a na okura no kum Misraimni ɔkofo kɛse bi a na ɔno kura peaw. Benaia hwim peaw no fii Misraimni no nsam, na ɔde kum no. <verse eid="2SA 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22"/>Eyinom na Yehoiada babarima Benaia yɛe, ma ogyee din te sɛ Baasa no. <verse eid="2SA 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23"/>Na ɔwɔ anuonyam sen wɔn a na wɔfra Aduasa no mu no biara, nanso na ɔnka Baasa no ho. Na Dawid yɛɛ no nʼawɛmfo no so sahene.<verse eid="2SA 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24"/>Wɔn a aka a na wɔfra Aduasa no mu no ni:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:24"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Yoab nuabarima Asahel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Dodo a ofi Betlehem babarima Elhanan;<verse eid="2SA 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25"/>Sama a ofi Harod;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:25">Elika a ofi Harod;<verse eid="2SA 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26"/>Heles a ofi Palti;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:26">Ira, Ikes a ofi Tekoa babarima;<verse eid="2SA 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27"/>Abieser a ofi Anatot;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:27">Sibekai a ofi Husa;<verse eid="2SA 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28"/>Salmon a ofi Ahoa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:28">Maharai a ofi Netofa;<verse eid="2SA 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29"/>Heleb, Baana a ofi Netofa babarima;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:29">Itai, Ribai a ofi Gibea (Benyamin abusuakuw mu) babarima;<verse eid="2SA 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30"/>Benaia a ofi Piraton;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:30">Hidai a ofi Nahale-Gaas;<verse eid="2SA 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31"/>Arbatini Abi-Albon;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:31">Asmawet a ofi Bahurim;<verse eid="2SA 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32"/>Eliahba a ofi Saalbon;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32">Yaasen mmabarima;<verse eid="2SA 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33"/>Yonatan, Sama a ofi Harar babarima;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:33">Sarar, Ahiam a ofi Maaka babarima;<verse eid="2SA 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34"/>Elifelet, Ahasbai a ofi Maaka babarima;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:34">Eliam, Ahitofel a ofi Gilo babarima;<verse eid="2SA 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35"/>Hesro a ofi Karmel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:35">Paarai a ofi Arba;<verse eid="2SA 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36"/>Igal, Natan a ofi Soba babarima;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:36">Bani a ofi Gad;<verse eid="2SA 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37"/>Selek a ofi Amon;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:37">Naharai a ofi Beerot (Yoab akodekurafo);<verse eid="2SA 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38"/>Ira a ofi Yitri;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:38">Gareb a ofi Yitri;<verse eid="2SA 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39"/>Hetini Uria.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:39"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="2SA 23:39">Wɔn nyinaa dodow yɛ aduasa ason.<verse eid="2SA 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Kan Nnipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1"/>Bio, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuw baa Israel so nti, ɔhyɛɛ Dawid sɛ ɔmfa nnipakan so nhaw wɔn a wɔwɔ Israel ne Yuda nyinaa. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> see Dawid sɛ, “Kɔ na kɔkan Israelfo ne Yudafo nyinaa.”<verse eid="2SA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2"/>Enti ɔhene no ka kyerɛɛ ne sahene Yoab se, “Kan nnipa a wɔwɔ asase yi so nyinaa, efi Dan a ɛwɔ atifi fam, de besi Beer-Seba a ɛwɔ anafo fam, na ama mahu nnipa dodow a wɔwɔ ha.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3"/>Na Yoab buaa ɔhene no se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> mma wo ntena ase kosi sɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ wʼahenni yi mu ase bɛterɛw mmɔho ɔha. Na adɛn nti na wopɛ sɛ woyɛ eyi?”<verse eid="2SA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4"/>Na ɔhene no hyɛɛ no ketee sɛ, wɔnkan nnipa nti, Yoab ne nʼadwumayɛfo kɔkan nnipa a wɔwɔ Israel.<verse eid="2SA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5"/>Nea edi kan no, wotwaa Yordan kɔtenaa Aroer, kurow a ɛwɔ obon no anafo a ɛkyerɛ Gad no. Afei, wɔkɔɔ Yaser, <verse eid="2SA 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6"/>toaa so koduu Gilead a ɛwɔ Tatim-hodsi, toaa so kɔɔ Dan Yaan ne Sidon fa mu. <verse eid="2SA 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7"/>Afei, wɔbaa Tiro aban mu ne Hewifo ne Kanaanfo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hewifo ne Kanaanfo nyinaa tenaa Kanaan ansa na Israelfo rebedi ɔman no so.</char></note> nkuropɔn nyinaa mu. Wɔkɔɔ Yuda anafo, koduu Beer-Seba de wiei.<verse eid="2SA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8"/>Wowurawuraa asase no nyinaa so, de asram akron ne nnafua aduonu wiee nnipakan no, san kɔɔ Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9"/>Yoab de ne nnipa dodow a wonyae brɛɛ ɔhene no. Na mmarima a wɔadu sogyadi mfe so wɔ Israel no dodow yɛ mpem ahanwɔtwe, na mpem ahannum nso wɔ Yuda.<verse eid="2SA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Bɔne So Atemmu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10"/>Dawid kan nnipa no nyinaa wiei no, nʼahonim buu no fɔ, nti ɔka kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Nea meyɛe yi nti, mayɛ bɔne. Enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mesrɛ wo, yi saa afɔbu yi fi wo somfo so. Mayɛ nkwaseade.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11"/>Ade kyee no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa odiyifo Gad a ɔyɛ Dawid ɔdehufo nkyɛn se: <verse eid="2SA 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12"/>“Kɔka kyerɛ Dawid sɛ, Sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: ‘Mede nsɛm abiɛsa reto wʼanim. Yi mu baako na menyɛ ntia wo.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13"/>Enti Gad kɔɔ Dawid nkyɛn kobisaa no se, “Ɔkɔm mmra wʼasase yi so mfe abiɛsa ana? Anaa, atamfo a wogu wo so no wubeguan wɔn asram abiɛsa? Anaa, ɔyaredɔm mmra wo man yi mu nnansa? Enti afei, dwene ho yiye, na ma minhu mmuae a memfa nkɔma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14"/>Dawid ka kyerɛɛ Gad se, “Yɛwɔ ahohiahia mu. Momma yɛmfa yɛn ho nhyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsa, efisɛ nʼadɔe dɔɔso; nanso mma me nkɔtɔ nnipa nsam.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15"/>Enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tow ɔyaredɔm guu Israel so anɔpa no ma edii nnansa. Na nnipa mpem aduɔson fii Dan kosi Beer-Seba wuwui. <verse eid="2SA 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16"/>Bere a ɔbɔfo no reyɛ ahoboa akɔsɛe Yerusalem no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nuu ne ho wɔ asɛm no ho, na ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Eye! Gyae.” Saa bere no na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔfo no adu Yebusini Arauna awiporowbea hɔ.<verse eid="2SA 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17"/>Bere a Dawid huu ɔbɔfo no, ɔka kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Me na mayɛ bɔne. Eyinom de wonnim ho hwee, dɛn na wɔayɛ? Ma wo bɔfo nsɛe me ne me fifo.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Si Afɔremuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18"/>Da no, Gad kɔɔ Dawid nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Kɔ na kosi afɔremuka ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ Yebusini Arauna awiporowbea hɔ.”<verse eid="2SA 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19"/>Na Dawid kɔyɛɛ nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no. <verse eid="2SA 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20"/>Bere a Arauna huu sɛ ɔhene ne ne mmarima reba no, opue bɛkotow ɔhene, de nʼanim butuw fam.<verse eid="2SA 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21"/>Arauna bisae se, “Adɛn nti na woaba, me wura?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Dawid buae se, “Merebɛtɔ awiporowbea hɔ, na masi afɔremuka wɔ hɔ ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma ɔyaredɔm no agyae.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22"/>Arauna ka kyerɛɛ Dawid se, “Me wura fa na fa yɛ nea wopɛ. Nantwi a wɔde bɛbɔ ɔhyew afɔre ni. Wubetumi de awiporowbea nnua ne nantwi mpamho nnua no ayɛ nnyina wɔ afɔremuka no so. <verse eid="2SA 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23"/>Mede ne nyinaa bɛma wo, na mesrɛ se, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Nyankopɔn nnye afɔre yi.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24"/>Na ɔhene no buaa Arauna se, “Dabi da, mepɛ sɛ mɛtɔ, na merentumi mmɔ ɔhyew afɔre mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, me Nyankopɔn, a mammɔ ho ka biara.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Enti Dawid tuaa dwetɛ bɛyɛ gram ahannum aduoson anum (575) de tɔɔ awiporowbea ne nantwi no. <verse eid="2SA 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25"/>Dawid sii afɔremuka wɔ hɔ maa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ɔbɔɔ ɔhyew afɔre ne asomdwoe afɔre hɔ. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tiee ne mpaebɔ maa ɔyaredɔm no gyaee.<verse eid="2SA 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24"/>
</usx>
